le | burunyuu \n\n- Resource-pack includes: localization(RU, EN, UA), model and totem break sound.\n\n> **Requires [CIT Resewn](https://modrinth.com/mod/cit-resewn)**\n\nVideo preview: https://youtu.be/MceABKj4S2o\n\nChaos version: rename the totem to: `Chaos of undying`\n\n![Banner](https://i.imgur.com/ZtNyIPZ.png)\n\n*NYANYA!*","2023-10-15T21:36:55.568150Z","2023-10-18T19:13:30.151856Z","2023-10-16T21:32:05.831282Z","2023-10-15T23:08:12.855143Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":3565},1031,[148],[15,50,165,197],[377],[31937,31938],"mEyQn5dr","AUPU1qJs","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kq8dDgVV/c3efbf0f97df68ef69340ab4e20c02df744b5e4c_96.webp",[31941],{"id":3125,"platform":3126,"url":31942},"https://donationalerts.com/r/quavier",[31944,31950,31956,31961,31967,31973,31979],{"url":31945,"raw_url":31946,"featured":439,"title":31947,"description":31948,"created":31949,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kq8dDgVV/images/0fec455613294f8b95a9fac8bb2d29610a67d651_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kq8dDgVV/images/0fec455613294f8b95a9fac8bb2d29610a67d651.png","Chaos: Why...","Neco-arc chaos in item frame on barrier","2023-10-18T19:20:51.923472Z",{"url":31951,"raw_url":31952,"featured":822,"title":31953,"description":31954,"created":31955,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kq8dDgVV/images/133ae8d60e7b33b2b199c620cd7e5f9e6b9b6030_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kq8dDgVV/images/133ae8d60e7b33b2b199c620cd7e5f9e6b9b6030.png","Why...","Neco-totem in invisible frame on barrier","2023-10-16T14:04:02.310147Z",{"url":31957,"raw_url":31957,"featured":439,"title":31958,"description":31959,"created":31960,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kq8dDgVV/images/2f5d32cdd43985885ac6c03aba376d8977aff9a3.png","Neco-interface","How neco looks like in containers","2023-10-16T17:42:45.455873Z",{"url":31962,"raw_url":31963,"featured":439,"title":31964,"description":31965,"created":31966,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kq8dDgVV/image