                    | Brings Terraria's amazing storage features to Minecraft.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n| [ToolTipFix](https://modrinth.com/mod/tooltipfix)                                       | Fixes tooltip display issues.                                                                                                                                                                                                               \n| [Viafabricplus](https://modrinth.com/mod/viafabricplus)                                 | Enables cross-version compatibility for multiplayer servers.                                                  \n| [World-Host](https://modrinth.com/mod/world-host)                                       | Host singleplayer worlds online for friends to join easily.                                                   \n| [World Play Time](https://modrinth.com/mod/world-play-time)                             | Tracks and displays the total playtime in each world.                                                         \n| [Your Options Shall Be Respected](https://modrinth.com/mod/yosbr)                       | Maintains player settings even on servers.                                                                    \n| [Yungs Bridges](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-bridges)                                 | Adds naturally generated bridges to improve exploration and navigation.                                       \n| [Yungs Better Desert Temples](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-desert-temples)     | Revamps desert temples with more intricate designs and improved loot.                                         \n| [Yungs Better End Island](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-end-island)             | Enhances End Islands with improved terrain and unique features.                                               \n| [Yungs Better Jungle Temples](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-jungle-temples)     | Upgrades jungle temples with intricate designs and enhanced challenges.                                       \n| [Yungs Better Mineshafts](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-mineshafts)             | Reimagines mineshafts with sprawling layouts and immersive details.                                           \n| [Yungs Better Nether Fortresses](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-nether-fortresses) | Enhances Nether fortresses with intricate designs and improved exploration.                                   \n| [Yungs Better Ocean Monuments](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-ocean-monuments)   | Revamps ocean monuments with enhanced layouts and new challenges.                                             \n| [Yungs Better Strongholds](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-strongholds)           | Completely overhauls strongholds with expansive layouts and intricate designs.                                \n| [Yungs Better Witch Huts](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-witch-huts)             | Transforms witch huts into larger, more detailed structures with added features.                              \n| [Yungs Extras](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-extras)                                   | Adds small but impactful vanilla+ structures like ruins, pillars, desert wells, and more.                     \n| [Zoomify](https://modrinth.com/mod/zoomify)                                             | Allows zooming in and out of the screen.  \n| [Fancy Health Bar](https://modrinth.com/mod/fancy-health-bar)                                            | Adds health lose particles.  \n| [Lighty](https://modrinth.com/mod/lighty)                                            | Allows to turn on an overlay to check lighted areas.   |\n\n\u003C/details>\n    \n______________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n## 🔊 Sound\n\nVinland Survival doesn't just enhance what you see - it transforms what you hear. A selected suite of sound mods brings the game world to life with rich, dynamic audio. From the echoes of dripping water in caves to the immersive rumble of distant thunder, every sound has been refined to draw you deeper into the experience. Hear the crunch of footsteps, the whisper of wind and the ambience of a living, breathing world like never before. Let Vinland redefine your audio adventure!\n\n| Mod                                                                 | Summary                                                                                     |\n|---------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| [AmbientSounds](https://modrinth.com/mod/ambientsounds)             | Enhances the immersive experience by adding ambient sounds to different biomes and environments in Minecraft. |\n| [Auditory](https://modrinth.com/mod/auditory-continued)             | Improves the audio experience by enhancing sound effects and adding depth to the game's auditory atmosphere. |\n| [Coolrain](https://modrinth.com/mod/coolrain)                       | Creates ambient sounds for certain blocks during rain. |\n| [Drip Sounds](https://modrinth.com/mod/dripsounds-fabric)           | Adds realistic dripping sounds to caves and underground areas, enhancing the environmental ambience. |\n| [Dynamic Surroundings](https://modrinth.com/mod/dynamicsurroundingsfabric)          | Alters the fabric of Minecraft experience by weaving a tapestry of sound and visual effects. |\n| [Immersive Thunder](https://modrinth.com/mod/immersivethunder)      | Adds dynamic thunder sounds for a more immersive experience.                                   |\n| [Presence Footsteps](https://modrinth.com/mod/presence-footsteps)   | Enhances immersion by adding realistic footstep sounds that vary based on the surface being walked on. |\n| [Sound Physics Remastered](https://modrinth.com/mod/sound-physics-remastered) | Improves the realism of sound propagation in the game, making audio behave more realistically based on distance and obstacles. |\n| [Sounds](https://modrinth.com/mod/sound)                           | Enhances and expands the range of sound effects in Minecraft, adding more depth and variety to the auditory experience. |\n\n______________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n## 🎮 Play With Your Friends\n\nVinland Survival makes multiplayer easier than ever! A fully integrated system allows you to open your world for your friends or join theirs directly in-game without additional services or complex setups. Just launch the game and start your adventure together in seconds! Plus, we’ve included a proximity chat system for a more immersive experience, allowing you to hear nearby players and feel genuinely connected to the world of Vinland.\n\n- [World-Host](https://modrinth.com/mod/world-host) | Host singleplayer worlds online for friends to join easily.   \n- [Plasmo Voice](https://modrinth.com/plugin/plasmo-voice) | Proximity voice chat.\n- [PV SoundPhysics](https://modrinth.com/mod/pv-addon-soundphysics) | With this add-on Plasmo Voice will be affected by Sound Physics.\n\n______________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n## 📜 Almost Full Mod List\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Open For More Information\u003C/summary>\n\n- [Nullscape](https://modrinth.com/datapack/nullscape) | Boosts the End's height to 384 blocks, and makes full use of 1.18's modern features to generate incredibly varied terrain\n- [Badoptimizations](https://modrinth.com/mod/badoptimizations) | Fixes and improves poorly optimized vanilla mechanics.\n- [Blanket](https://modrinth.com/mod/blanket) | Optimizes texture loading for improved performance.\n- [Chunks fade in](https://modrinth.com/mod/chunks-fade-in) | Smooths chunk transition while loading the world.\n- [Clumps](https://modrinth.com/mod/clumps) | Groups nearby xp entities to reduce server load\n- [Concurrent Chunk Management Engine](https://modrinth.com/mod/c2me-fabric) | Improves chunk management for smoother performance.\n- [Debugify](https://modrinth.com/mod/debugify) | Provides debugging tools for diagnosing performance issues.\n- [Dynamic FPS](https://modrinth.com/mod/dynamic-fps) | Dynamically adjusts frame rate for better performance.\n- [Enhanced Block Entities](https://modrinth.com/mod/ebe) | Optimizes block entity processing for smoother gameplay.\n- [Entity Culling](https://modrinth.com/mod/entityculling) | Removes invisible entities to alleviate server load.\n- [FerriteCore](https://modrinth.com/mod/ferrite-core) | Increases chunk processing efficiency to enhance performance.\n- [FeyTweaks](https://modrinth.com/mod/feytweaks) | Small performance improvements and gameplay tweaks.\n- [Highlight](https://modrinth.com/mod/highlight) | Highlights and fixes certain elements for easy identification during gameplay.\n- [ImmediatelyFast](https://modrinth.com/mod/immediatelyfast) | Reduces input latency for faster player response.\n- [Indium](https://modrinth.com/mod/indium) | Optimizes rendering for improved performance.\n- [Krypton](https://modrinth.com/mod/krypton) | Improves network performance to reduce latency.\n- [Ksyxis](https://modrinth.com/mod/ksyxis) | Speed up the loading of your world.\n- [Lithium](https://modrinth.com/mod/lithium) | Improves server performance through various optimizations.\n- [Memory Leak Fix](https://modrinth.com/mod/memoryleakfix) | Fixes memory leaks to prevent performance issues.\n- [Mixintrace](https://modrinth.com/mod/mixintrace) | adds a list of mixins to classes in the stack trace to crash reports.\n- [ModernFix](https://modrinth.com/mod/modernfix) | Fixes bugs and optimizations for improved performance.\n- [More Culling](https://modrinth.com/mod/moreculling) | Increases efficiency of entity removal for better performance.\n- [Noisium](https://modrinth.com/mod/noisium) | Reduces game-generated noise to improve performance.\n- [Noxesium](https://modrinth.com/mod/noxesium) | Improves rendering performance for smoother gameplay.\n- [Sodium](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium) | Implements an optimized rendering engine for better performance.\n- [Sodium Dynamic Lights](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium-dynamic-lights) | An unofficial Forge/multiloader port of LambDynamicLights that integrates with Sodium.\n- [Sodium Extra](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium-extra) | Provides additional features for the Sodium mod.\n- [Sodium Leaf Culling](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodiumleafculling) | Smart leaf culling algorithm (Only on 1.21.1).\n- [ThreadTweak](https://modrinth.com/mod/threadtweak) | Optimizes thread usage to improve game performance.\n- [Very Many Players](https://modrinth.com/mod/vmp-fabric) | Improves performance on servers with many players.\n- [Advancement Plaques](https://modrinth.com/mod/advancement-plaques) | Adds decorative achievement plaques to the game.                                                                                 \n- [Capes](https://modrinth.com/mod/capes) | Allows players to wear custom capes.                                                          \n- [Cave Dust](https://modrinth.com/mod/cave-dukeest) | Adds dust particles in caves for visual effects.                                                                                     \n- [Explosive Enhancement](https://modrinth.com/mod/explosive-enhancement) | Enhances visual effects of explosions.                                                        \n- [Falling Leaves](https://modrinth.com/mod/fallingleaves) | Adds falling leaves from trees for a more realistic atmosphere.                                                    \n- [Fancymenu](https://modrint