peg)\n\nWe hope you like this modpack!","2025-01-22T09:14:58.645960Z","2025-01-26T17:32:24.499003Z","2025-01-24T23:10:51.986805Z","2025-01-22T09:33:45.296310Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved",506,1,[162,200,211],[],[346],[29984,29985,29986,29987,29988],"XJX88HSE","hH7ZZzHZ","SzBJEFmF","CtwRCU9z","CZyVJpJt","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqVpU29R/48382b7f80a76c63700aad9e01efcad70172caeb_96.webp",[],[29992,29999],{"url":29993,"raw_url":29994,"featured":439,"title":29995,"description":29996,"created":29997,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqVpU29R/images/09d775690aab66077e135e8870a57eff31901557_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqVpU29R/images/09d775690aab66077e135e8870a57eff31901557.jpeg","Preview 2","This is the **2nd** Preview of SMP Craft","2025-01-22T09:32:11.401665Z",0,{"url":30000,"raw_url":30001,"featured":439,"title":30002,"description":30003,"created":30004,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqVpU29R/images/f4ddec41b42fdbb69100b796d27e4d0b55ed8b34_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqVpU29R/images/f4ddec41b42fdbb69100b796d27e4d0b55ed8b34.jpeg","Preview 1","This is the **1st** Preview of SMP Craft","2025-01-22T09:31:51.898165Z",10401967,"ggZVV4Pk","monetized",{"client_side":29964,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":30009,"id":30010,"slug":30011,"project_type":31,"team":30012,"organization":3565,"title":30013,"description":30014,"body":30015,"body_url":3565,"published":30016,"updated":30017,"approved":30018,"queued":3565,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":30019,"downloads":30022,"followers":30023,"categories":30024,"additional_categories":30025,"loaders":30026,"versions":30027,"icon_url":3565,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":30030,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":30031,"gallery":30032,"color":3565,"thread_id":30010,"monetization_status":30007},[1367,1349,1286,1271,1244,1187,1154,1145,1109,1022,1016],"kpjyEyU2","killslog","cd2lbmCY","KillsLog","Logs player kills by players. Saves inventory and places.","# KillsLog\n**Allows you to view all player kills by players.**\n\n## Commands\n- **/kills** - help menu\n- **/kills last** - last 5 kills\n- **/kills search** \u003Ckiller/victim> \u003Cnick> - search for the murderer/victim by nickname\n- **/kills id \u003CID>** - search by ID\n\n## Buttons inside the responses:\n- **[inv]/[inventory]** - opens the inventory of the victim at the time of the kill\n- **[pos]/[position]** - menu with the coordinates of the kill\n- **[DELETE]** - delete entry\n- **[TP]** - teleport to place \n- **[COPY]** - copy coordinates of the kill\n","2023-01-11T11:45:35.919463Z","2023-07-29T16:01:47.941317Z","2023-01-11T21:56:16.231248Z",{"id":30020,"name":30021,"url":3565},"GPL-3.0-only","GNU General Public License v3.0 only",279,2,[175],[],[401,405,417],[30028,30029],"HkNxrWyT","JcVUDR6y","https://github.com/Ktilis/KillsLog",[],[],{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":30034,"id":30035,"slug":30036,"project_type":31,"team":30037,"organization":3565,"title":30038,"description":30039,"body":30040,"body_url":3565,"published":30041,"updated":30042,"approved":30043,"queued":30044,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":30045,"downloads":30048,"followers":30049,"categories":30050,"additional_categories":30051,"loaders":30052,"versions":30053,"icon_url":30061,"issues_url":30062,"source_url":30063,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":30064,"gallery":30067,"color":30088,"thread_id":30089,"monetization_status":30007},[820,814,766,763,733,685,643,634,628,583,577,532],"kpbD49Kv","cursed-spawners","ZwwXYbE4","Cursed Spawners","Makes spawners far more dangerous than they need to be.","# Cursed Spawners\nThis is a mod made specifically to make mob spawners (not trial spawners) significantly harder to deal with via multiple avenues of pain.\n\nSpawners will randomly select up to 7 actions that they can perform. These include periodic effects such as knocking away players,\nand active responses, such as performing actions when broken.\n\nAdditionally, spawners have the chance to become mimics when broken. The Spawner Mimic is a fast and heavily armoured mob that will continue\nto spawn other mobs from the original spawner nbt.\n\nLastly, the mining speed of spawners has been modified.\n\n\u003Ccenter>\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbD49Kv/images/31fa685dd6b156ac7846b1a7568b4bceba2deb8d.gif)\n\n\u003C/center>\n\n\nAll three major features can be controlled by gamerules and NBT data. Allowing builders and datapack makers to intentionally produce dungeons\nthat exploit these features. For spawners with no NBT from this mod, they will generate it themselves on the next tick. \n\n### Action Intervals\nSpawners can chance to perform actions on an interval.\n- Knock away nearby players.\n- Heal nearby hostile mobs.\n- Grant movement speed to nearby hostile mobs.\n\n\u003Ccenter>\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbD49Kv/images/9b08cd9255790c4be4354e33032b5ef4c9ee4aac.gif)\n\n\u003C/center>\n\nThese actions will generate with a random effect radius, interval, and efficacy. All three are indicated by a shrinking floor particle.\n\n### Breaking Actions\nThere are two types of effect that can trigger when a spawner is broken.\n- Reforge\n  - Prevents the spawner from being broken. It is consumed when called and acts like an extra life for the spawner. \n- Break\n  - Triggers when the spawner is properly broken. \n\n\u003Ccenter>\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbD49Kv/images/89048e97e741409709c1970ed53d10ba053171b5.gif)\n\n\u003C/center>\n\nReforge and break actions pull from the same pool of possibilities:\n- Summon vexes.\n- Summon silverfish.\n- Blind and poison the player.\n\n## Gamerules\n- `spawnerActionChance`\n  - The chance for spawners to be granted an ability.\n  - Rolls the chance up to 7 times.\n- `spawnerMimicChance`\n  - The chance for a spawner to become a mimic when broken.\n  - This is overridden by the NBT data on the spawner if set to a value above 0.\n  - This rate applies to spawners with the default chance of -1.\n- `spawnerMiningSpeedModifier`\n  - Modifies the mining speed for breaking a spawner.\n  - Lower values make spawners harder to break.","2024-08-13T21:47:54.333661Z","2025-12-23T17:16:50.600069Z","2024-08-15T08:41:11.506300Z","2024-08-13T23:23:59.042953Z",{"id":30046,"name":10,"url":30047},"LicenseRef-Lily-License-v1.1","https://github.com/Provismet/Cursed-Spawners/blob/1.21/LICENSE",2461,20,[134,191],[30,93],[346,409],[30054,30055,30056,30057,30058,30059,30060],"fcTSl1BC","YQEpYLRi","Dmf4STFD","LRxrShmd","5ZtDWVlZ","hVjJL4Rt","itPhn3cc","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbD49Kv/b091c53557f7adeaa38733318d4e3d56147d7980.png","https://github.com/Provismet/Cursed-Spawners/issues","https://github.com/Provismet/Cursed-Spawners",[30065],{"id":3122,"platform":3123,"url":30066},"https://ko-fi.com/provismet",[30068,30073,30078,30083],{"url":30069,"raw_url":30069,"featured":439,"title":30070,"description":30071,"created":30072,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbD49Kv/images/31fa685dd6b156ac7846b1a7568b4bceba2deb8d.gif","Spawner Mimics","Spawners can become mimics when broken.","2024-08-13T22:35:16.304697Z",{"url":30074,"raw_url":30074,"featured":439,"title":30075,"description":30076,"created":30077,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbD49Kv/images/8614a22472d8e844856b9607bb35c234f7200d8d.gif","Reforging","Spawners can have extra lives, and perform a special action when consuming one of their lives.","2024-08-13T22:34:23.190710Z",{"url":30079,"raw_url":30079,"featured":439,"title":30080,"description":30081,"created":30082,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbD49Kv/images/89048e97e741409709c1970ed53d10ba053171b5.gif","Break Actions","Spawners can perform special actions when broken.","2024-08-13T22:00:40.899423Z",{"url":30084,"raw_url":30084,"featured":822,"title":30085,"description":30086,"created":30087,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbD49Kv/images/9b08cd9255790c4be4354e33032b5ef4c9ee4aac.gif","Interval Actions","Spawners can randomly select AOE actions to perform periodically.","2024-08-13T21:50:17.585257Z",263172,"vX95csTD",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":30091,"id":30092,"slug":30093,"project_type":34,"team":30094,"organization":30095,"title":30096,"description":30097,"body":30098,"body_url":3565,"published":30099,"updated":30100,"approved":30101,"queued":30102,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":30103,"downloads":30104,"followers":30105,"categories":30106,"additional_categories":30107,"loaders":30108,"versions":30109,"icon_url":30113,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":30114,"gallery":30115,"color":30116,"thread_id":30117,"monetization_status":30007},[1244],"kqyt1Cqq","farmcolonies","y4qrEzZ9","91yBQReV","FarmColonies","A modpack focused around farming, animal husbandry, colony life & more!","**FarmColonies** is a modpack that invites you to build a thriving community in a world brimming with life. With **Minecolonies**, you’ll establish settlements and manage your colonists, each with unique skills and talents. **SWEM** horses will add an extra layer of realism to otherwise mundane vanilla horses. Now they're loyal companions, helping you explore the diverse landscapes generated by a mix of **realistic** and **fantastical** terrain.\n\nBut be warned, the wild is full of surprises! **Naturalist** adds a layer of realism to the world around you, requiring you to . And with a variety of **quality of life mods**, you’ll find your experience enhanced with convenient features and helpful tools.\n\n**Farmers Delight** adds a plethora of new crops, foods, and farming tools, making your agricultural endeavors even more rewarding. You'll find yourself cultivating a wide variety of produce, from humble carrots to exotic fruits, and crafting delicious dishes that will keep your colonists happy and healthy.\n\n**Doggy Talents Next** allows you to train your canine companions to become even more helpful and loyal. You can teach them tricks, assign them specific tasks, and even breed them for unique abilities. With a loyal dog by your side, you'll be ready to face any challenge!\n\n**Some of the promenent QoL mods:**\n- **Jade** helps you to easily identify what you're looking at.\n- **Falling Tree** simplifies lumberjacking.\n- **Comforts** adds cozy furniture and decorations.\n- **AppleSkin** lets you track your hunger and health.\n- **Ambient Sounds** immerses you in the world.\n- **Simple Voice Chat** makes communication with your friends a breeze.\n- **JourneyMap** for a world map, minimap and waypoints to easily find your way home.\n- **Sophisticated Backpacks** for more storage on the go.\n- **Sophisticated Storage** for more expansive storage back home.\n\nAre you ready to build a farm, establish colonies, and conquer the wild?","2025-01-02T03:15:32.287841Z","2025-03-11T17:22:45.984016Z","2025-01-10T03:37:43.153803Z","2025-01-03T01:48:16.245813Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},1309,4,[30,162,200],[],[354],[30110,30111,30112],"qR1xehv1","WjRirVgM","7TYdzU7P","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqyt1Cqq/20712f29c4051b67fdf6abb78abed867925fd8ef_96.webp",[],[],4083771,"wgzJSLQe",{"client_side":30119,"server_side":30119,"game_versions":30120,"id":30121,"slug":30122,"project_type":31,"team":30123,"organization":3565,"title":30124,"description":30125,"body":30126,"body_url":3565,"published":30127,"updated":30128,"approved":30129,"queued":30130,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":30131,"downloads":30134,"followers":30135,"categories":30136,"additional_categories":30137,"loaders":30138,"versions":30139,"icon_url":30142,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":30143,"gallery":30144,"color"