etails>\n\u003Csummary>Connected Textures\u003C/summary>\nThis pack includes connected textures to make pillars any size you want.\n\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n","2025-11-12T14:49:58.080122Z","2026-02-15T22:18:01.716910Z","2026-02-20T02:16:05.793436Z","2026-02-15T22:19:47.096644Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},81,[100,300,307],[15,57,268],[377],[30194],"v1QZS5Rs","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpngwoPq/38ac4452cbb099b96209a7c7f484e2ceff7055fd_96.webp",[],[30198],{"url":30199,"raw_url":30199,"featured":822,"title":30200,"description":30201,"created":30202,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpngwoPq/images/d96f56dd50f277a971714a4c3961cd5175534a8d.gif","Connected Textures Support","Create pillars of any size!","2025-11-20T17:13:20.585133Z",8684676,"IPv4BwXL",{"client_side":29964,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":30206,"id":30207,"slug":30208,"project_type":31,"team":30209,"organization":3565,"title":30210,"description":30211,"body":30212,"body_url":3565,"published":30213,"updated":30214,"approved":30215,"queued":30216,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":30217,"downloads":30218,"followers":29979,"categories":30219,"additional_categories":30220,"loaders":30221,"versions":30222,"icon_url":30225,"issues_url":30226,"source_url":30227,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":30226,"donation_urls":30228,"gallery":30232,"color":30233,"thread_id":30234,"monetization_status":30007},[2507,2489,2462,2456,2453,2450,2447,2309,2258,2246,2243,2219,2216,2198,2195,2192,2144,2138,2135,2078,2069,2060,1901,1877,1868,1751,1742,1727,1712,1688,1619,1613,1604,1514,1511,1481,1475,1463,1442,1367,1349,1286,1271,1244,1187,1154,1145,1109,1070,1022,1016,983,941,935],"kqJGj6kP","deluxespawn","wK9kHhNm","DeluxeSpawn","Define your spawn, teleport in style with a splash of awesomeness!","Hey there! Interested in learning more about this fantastic plugin called DeluxeSpawn? I created it a few months ago with the goal of delving into the world of programming. Initially, it wasn't anything impressive or standout compared to the amazing plugins already out there. However, my aim was to learn more about programming, and while I wouldn't call myself an expert, I've got some skills.\n\nBut let's get to the point! DeluxeSpawn is a plugin dedicated to setting and going to a spawn. But that's not all – you can also set a spawn per world. If that's not your cup of tea, simply deactivate it and use it as a regular spawn plugin. Additionally, you can create a lobby. Imagine being able to direct players to this lobby upon entering your server and then sending them to a specific location or another spawn.\n\nWant players to be able to return to where they were when they disconnected? No problem! My plugin includes an option to save the last location. You can also run commands, play sounds, and more. I encourage you to give DeluxeSpawn a shot; perhaps you'll find it to be a perfect fit for your server. Give it a try and take your gaming experience to the next level!\n‎ \n‎ \n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Español\u003C/summary>\n\n  \n¡Hola! ¿Te gustaría conocer más sobre este increíble plugin llamado DeluxeSpawn? Lo creé hace unos meses con el propósito de sumergirme en el mundo de la programación. Inicialmente, no era nada impresionante ni destacado en comparación con los plugins asombrosos que ya existen. Sin embargo, mi objetivo era aprender más sobre programación, y aunque no me considero un experto, tengo ciertos conocimientos.\n\n \nPero, ¡vamos al grano! DeluxeSpawn es un plugin dedicado a establecer y dirigirse a un spawn. Pero eso no es todo, también puedes asignar un spawn por mundo. Si esta opción no es de tu agrado, simplemente desactívala y úsalo como un plugin normal de spawn. Además, tienes la posibilidad de crear un lobby. Imagina poder dirigir a los jugadores a este lobby al ingresar a tu servidor y luego enviarlos a un lugar específico o a otro spawn.\n‎ \n\n¿Te gustaría que los jugadores pudieran regresar al lugar donde estaban cuando se desconectaron? ¡No hay problema! Mi plugin incluye una opción para guardar la última ubicación. También puedes ejecutar comandos, reproducir sonidos y mucho más. Te invito a darle una oportunidad a DeluxeSpawn; quizás encuentres que es una opción perfecta para tu servidor. ¡Anímate a probarlo y lleva tu experiencia de juego al siguiente nivel!\n‎ \n\u003C/details>\n\n","2024-03-10T18:18:47.845251Z","2024-03-11T16:37:37.997543Z","2024-03-12T21:11:50.622608Z","2024-03-10T20:03:43.202104Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":3565},394,[],[],[329,401,405,417],[30223,30224],"Sn2XfWgn","AQ7hPFDG","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqJGj6kP/3f1ed6183e444176de14104ba362e484275f41fb.jpeg","https://discord.com/invite/gcGarEbbbb","https://github.com/MiniPixesoj/DeluxeSpawn",[30229],{"id":3116,"platform":30230,"url":30231},"Paypal","https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=CXS53TZCNW89W",[],6304260,"PgO1GNhf",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":30236,"id":30237,"slug":30238,"project_type":31,"team":30239,"organization":3565,"title":30240,"description":30241,"body":30242,"body_url":3565,"published":30243,"updated":30244,"approved":30245,"queued":30246,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":30247,"downloads":30250,"followers":29998,"categories":30251,"additional_categories":30252,"loaders":30253,"versions":30254,"icon_url":30291,"issues_url":30292,"source_url":30293,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":30294,"gallery":30295,"color":30296,"thread_id":30297,"monetization_status":30007},[2609],"krUBzcyg","ok-core","dhg3uing","OK Core","Just a core mod used in other mod","## **Required Dependencies:**\n\n*   [ModularUI](https://modrinth.com/mod/modularui)\n*   [GTNHLib](https://modrinth.com/mod/gtnhlib)\n*   [UniMixins](https://modrinth.com/mod/unimixins)\n\nJust a core mod used in other mod  \n  \nFeature: \n\n*   Json Loader\n*   Capabilites system\n*   Fast NBT write/read in TileEntity and Wor