:31068,"downloads":31069,"followers":29998,"categories":31070,"additional_categories":31071,"loaders":31072,"versions":31073,"icon_url":31076,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":31077,"donation_urls":31078,"gallery":31079,"color":31085,"thread_id":31086,"monetization_status":30007},[820,814,766,763,733,685,643,634,628,583,577,532],"kqq883R5","anti-pickup","OORqYFRF","Anti-pickup","a pvp focused anti-pick up mod to help with inventory management in survival multiplayer servers","a client-side Fabric mod that automatically drops unwanted items from your inventory. You choose what to drop using blacklist or whitelist mode with built-in toggles for common categories like armor, swords, tools, totems, crystals, anchors, glowstone, obsidian, and blocks, plus custom item IDs. It works when your inventory is open by default, but it can run in the background too. All settings are configurable in-game through Mod Menu. ","2026-02-23T08:34:47.186350Z","2026-02-23T15:49:19.448675Z","2026-02-27T02:46:16.546518Z","2026-02-23T15:50:53.750999Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":3565},212,[303],[],[346],[31074,31075],"3TdNJx99","WBaPSqRb","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqq883R5/ce5de62ffe5e3d866cbd0fcac41a0589306bbbde_96.webp","https://discord.gg/E2Rp92cfv3",[],[31080],{"url":31081,"raw_url":31082,"featured":439,"title":31083,"description":3565,"created":31084,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqq883R5/images/0a2f734a36b6f8862a5ae097a13a421d20b266db_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqq883R5/images/0a2f734a36b6f8862a5ae097a13a421d20b266db.png","mod menu config","2026-02-23T08:43:44.686766Z",15207974,"lE8BqTtt",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29964,"game_versions":31088,"id":31089,"slug":31090,"project_type":31,"team":31091,"organization":3565,"title":31092,"description":31093,"body":31094,"body_url":3565,"published":31095,"updated":31096,"approved":31097,"queued":31098,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31099,"downloads":31102,"followers":29979,"categories":31103,"additional_categories":31104,"loaders":31105,"versions":31106,"icon_url":31109,"issues_url":31110,"source_url":31111,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31112,"gallery":31115,"color":31116,"thread_id":31117,"monetization_status":30007},[532,478,472,459],"krXttdOI","nether-fog-removed","bCcUhBdH","Nether Fog Removed","Removes all types of fog, there is a hotkey!","**Default key is \u003CDelete> on your keyboard(you can change at keybinds)**, there is 3 modes, first removes only the nether fog, second removes all fog(like inside water or fire) and third turns fog back to normal. To change the mode, press \u003CDelete> (or any other key you have replaced it with)\n\nThere you have!","2026-02-21T09:22:28.588951Z","2026-04-14T09:11:08.374249Z","2026-02-25T01:19:34.099315Z","2026-02-21T10:29:09.148404Z",{"id":31100,"name":31101,"url":3565},"MPL-2.0","Mozilla Public License 2.0",2814,[134,303],[30,288,297],[346],[31107,31108],"nOSWsIQH","bwdoFtK0","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krXttdOI/24541a4d8bbd65dd8125907f58073f65affa76a1_96.webp","https://github.com/dcqout/NetherFog/issues","https://github.com/dcqout/NetherFog",[31113],{"id":3122,"platform":3123,"url":31114},"https://ko-fi.com/dcqout",[],2889233,"GylLSRJr",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31119,"id":31120,"slug":31121,"project_type":34,"team":31122,"organization":3565,"title":31123,"description":31124,"body":31125,"body_url":3565,"published":31126,"updated":31127,"approved":31128,"queued":31129,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31130,"downloads":31131,"followers":29998,"categories":31132,"additional_categories":31133,"loaders":31134,"versions":31135,"icon_url":31137,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31138,"gallery":31139,"color":31140,"thread_id":31141,"monetization_status":30007},[1244],"kqTCS2dN","time-skip","mHaekAB4","Timeskip","TimeSkip is a lightweight 1.12.2/1.16.5/1.18.2 minecraft modpack featuring space exploration and Technology.","![The Logo of Timeskip](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c1ff38e49a1e041060382b8c10069fda43e6048c.png)\n---------\nTimeSkip is a lightweight 1.12.2/1.16.5/1.18.2 minecraft modpack featuring space exploration and Technology. (Other versions are on our CURSEFORGE PAGE)\n\n \n\nWill you build a space ship and explore space? or will you crash and burn trying to take off?\n\n**Only one person can control this outcome, and that person is YOU**\n\n---------\n# NOTE\n\nNot all versions will be the same, they will be very much different in many ways, however the goals are the same.\n\n**Sometimes, there may be outdated mods inside of the modpacks, however as soon as I realized they need updates, I will post them**\n\n---------\nUse Code 'Matriarch\" for 15% off your first month with [https://billing.kinetichosting.net/aff.php?aff=168](https://billing.kinetichosting.net/aff.php?aff=168)! \n![Kinetic Hosting Partner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a40fdc00e4a33c175a904ced1ac1e2be84f089ed_0.webp)","2025-07-04T01:25:23.739523Z","2025-07-04T04:16:18.405600Z","2025-07-10T15:30:06.079022Z","2025-07-04T04:27:23.581530Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},124,[],[],[354],[31136],"zZoJN5RE","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqTCS2dN/0568b19ebb055699ebaccdb4186f9470aa565888_96.webp",[],[],263431,"q5pxkWvO",{"client_side":29964,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31143,"id":31144,"slug":31145,"project_type":31,"team":31146,"organization":3565,"title":31147,"description":31148,"body":31149,"body_url":3565,"published":31150,"updated":31151,"approved":31152,"queued":31153,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31154,"downloads":31155,"followers":29998,"categories":31156,"additional_categories":31157,"loaders":31158,"versions":31159,"icon_url":31162,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":31163,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31164,"gallery":31165,"color":31229,"thread_id":31230,"monetization_status":30007},[820,814,766,763,733,685,643,634,628,583,577,532],"kpqr1Mcd","minechess-by-son14ka","CSUG7sgw","MineChess by SON14KA","A plugin for Minecraft Paper servers that adds functional chess game, namely chess board with figures and chess tutorial book","\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Spoiler\u003C/summary>\n\n_Has English and Ukrainian localizations._\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\n\n# Fully functional mini-chess in your server\n\nThis plugin adds to your server two new items: chess board and chess tutorial. They can be obtained only by crafting.\n\n![Chess board crafting recipe](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ed66963f999cc17216e682340fadf6d2f845526e.png)\n\n![Chess tutorial crafting recipe](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5dd2da134b4708d1ee3316d5ab22f60427448377.png)\n\nA single chess board takes 2 by 2 blocks in your world. To place it just **Right-click** on any horizontal space. To make moves, choose a figure by **Right-click**ing on it and then **Right-click** on decired cell. Any illigal moves are prevented and the corresponding messages will be sent in the chat. The game detects checks, checkmates, stalemates and draws (yes, there are draw in chess, not only stalemate) and visually informs about it any player in 3-block radius to the chess board. To break a chess board **Shift + Left-click** on it.\n\nTo open chess tutorial just **Right-click** into the air with the book in your hand.\n\n_**This plugin depends a lot on the resource pack. Without it there won't be any custom textures! So for your convenience install the resource pack as well. Here's a link to [MineChessTextures](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/minechesstextures)**_","2026-02-04T16:00:01.487461Z","2026-03-12T15:09:43.347427Z","2026-02-07T06:58:02.738827Z","2026-02-06T07:53:39.476250Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},33,[185],[],[401,405],[31160,31161],"cXbAZwL2","YwVcWKC3","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/e8f5368375807c637975b7f47434957835dfecb5.png","https://github.com/son14kaa/MineChess",[],[31166,31171,31176,31181,31186,31191,31196,31201,31205,31211,31216,31221,31225],{"url":31167,"raw_url":31168,"featured":439,"title":31169,"description":3565,"created":31170,"ordering":29979},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/df7c9faf26bb4ee29d1f309c6fb12dff7b965155_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/df7c9faf26bb4ee29d1f309c6fb12dff7b965155.png","White's perspective","2026-02-04T16:35:03.517769Z",{"url":31172,"raw_url":31173,"featured":439,"title":31174,"description":3565,"created":31175,"ordering":30023},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/dab64f17717c2698eb8459ab3063901f1ce57a80_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/dab64f17717c2698eb8459ab3063901f1ce57a80.png","Black's perspective","2026-02-04T16:36:30.801883Z",{"url":31177,"raw_url":31178,"featured":439,"title":31179,"description":3565,"created":31180,"ordering":30465},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/a81c7ca22cf805f35b058ec1957daded58b43a77_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/a81c7ca22cf805f35b058ec1957daded58b43a77.png","White figures","2026-02-04T16:36:46.844311Z",{"url":31182,"raw_url":31183,"featured":822,"title":31184,"description":3565,"created":31185,"ordering":30105},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/538f013419d69f80fbfb0f71e45cb1794cc5b0b7_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/538f013419d69f80fbfb0f71e45cb1794cc5b0b7.png","Black figures","2026-02-04T16:37:00.160190Z",{"url":31187,"raw_url":31188,"featured":439,"title":31189,"description":3565,"created":31190,"ordering":31048},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/a84f962d7c66d1a8217900f75548a7eea2d06d03_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/a84f962d7c66d1a8217900f75548a7eea2d06d03.png","White making a move","2026-02-04T16:37:42.068570Z",{"url":31192,"raw_url":31193,"featured":439,"title":31194,"description":3565,"created":31195,"ordering":31053},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/56739d12e6ad228e51aac141473babd321effed4_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/56739d12e6ad228e51aac141473babd321effed4.png","Black making a move","2026-02-04T16:37:22.418870Z",{"url":31197,"raw_url":31198,"featured":439,"title":31199,"description":3565,"created":31200,"ordering":30896},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/41c354079f590e4536283642a103a81de03a3045_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/41c354079f590e4536283642a103a81de03a3045.png","Chess board item in a frame","2026-02-04T16:38:05.908071Z",{"url":31202,"raw_url":31202,"featured":439,"title":31203,"description":3565,"created":31204,"ordering":30439},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/72c4fc9f40fae0828dcd803aa3e81aaaea79d8e3.png","Chess board craft recipe","2026-02-04T16:40:07.813304Z",{"url":31206,"raw_url":31207,"featured":439,"title":31208,"description":3565,"created":31209,"ordering":31210},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/b17405f3280cc7b706d04c622261649765a4bc83_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/b17405f3280cc7b706d04c622261649765a4bc83.png","Chess tutorial item in a frame","2026-02-04T16:38:33.096161Z",9,{"url":31212,"raw_url":31212,"featured":439,"title":31213,"description":3565,"created":31214,"ordering":31215},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/7c5aa0bedadeaf3064de4c78ffd799168b05e2a8.png","Chess tutorial craft recipe","2026-02-04T16:40:26.538640Z",10,{"url":31217,"raw_url":31217,"featured":439,"title":31218,"description":3565,"created":31219,"ordering":31220},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/728b36e316ed390fcef3c034046b0407576a66c8.png","Example of pages in a book","2026-02-04T16:39:26.810908Z",11,{"url":31222,"raw_url":31222,"featured":439,"title":31218,"description":3565,"created":31223,"ordering":31224},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/039360b87f21b43ddae0ff3b9740a382a27f1abb.png","2026-02-04T16:39:35.822098Z",12,{"url":31226,"raw_url":31226,"featured":439,"title":31218,"description":3565,"created":31227,"ordering":31228},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpqr1Mcd/images/9aedea3aceca1c45387b1d0ce26f524a8d5fcbbd.png","2026-02-04T16:39:45.784401Z",13,16559155,"818cmcFR",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31232,"id":31233,"slug":31234,"project_type":34,"team":31235,"organization":3565,"title":31236,"description":31237,"body":31238,"body_url":3565,"published":31239,"updated":31240,"approved":31241,"queued":31242,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31243,"downloads":31244,"followers":29979,"categories":31245,"additional_categories":31246,"loaders":31247,"versions":31248,"icon_url":31253,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31254,"gallery":31255,"color":31256,"thread_id":31257,"monetization_status":30007},[814],"kqqqlRi2","consortica-smp","1RzXICgD","Consortica","A Vanilla+ modpack focused around Iron's Spells and Spellbooks for the Consortica SMP.","Consortica is a Vanilla+ modpack focused around Iron's Spells and Spellbooks. Players can explore the beautiful landscapes of Oh The Biomes We've Gone in search of artifacts needed to learn and develop their magical abilities. Player will need to work together to develop of functioning community of magic users, trading resources and expanding the reaches of their mystical endeavors.\n\nWhile this pack is primarily intended for the use of the Consortica SMP, feel free to dive into the pack yourself and explore all the secrets there are to uncover!\n\nMake sure to check out some of the resources used in the pack below!\n- Vanilla Tweaks (Resource & Data packs): https://vanillatweaks.net/","2025-12-08T22:37:43.225867Z","2025-12-12T00:14:33.450619Z","2025-12-23T20:03:35.113063Z","2025-12-16T08:02:38.902552Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},69,[30,171,200],[],[385],[31249,31250,31251,31252],"m4Bz1TqP","4a0mtDJJ","ATF5yjOo","JWhpeH2y","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqqqlRi2/85d3fdfcda00008845fd301f188f23ae05259708_96.webp",[],[],15715389,"j0Wo2kQA",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29964,"game_versions":31259,"id":31260,"slug":31261,"project_type":34,"team":31262,"organization":3565,"title":31263,"description":31264,"body":31265,"body_url":3565,"published":31266,"updated":31267,"approved":31268,"queued":31269,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31270,"downloads":31271,"followers":29979,"categories":31272,"additional_categories":31273,"loaders":31274,"versions":31275,"icon_url":31281,"issues_url":31282,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":31282,"donation_urls":31283,"gallery":31284,"color":31285,"thread_id":31286,"monetization_status":30007},[1145,1016,935,820,814],"kpyYVa54","imwhys-modpack","3f13zPdt","ImWhy's modpack","A simple mod pack from me that will provide comfort for your game.","## **ImWhy's pvp modpack** \n A simple mod pack from me, which will provide a **comfortable game**, focusing on the **PvP segment**, with **good combination of mods**, helps in such types of PvP as:\n\n-  CPVP \n-  UHC\n-  Swords\n-  Axe\n-  Netherite Potion\n-  SMP\n\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Spoiler\u003C/summary>\n\nAlso good for vanilla gameplay\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\n## [How to install modpack?](https://docs.modrinth.com/docs/modpacks/playing_modpacks/#how-do-i-play-a-)\n\n\nU have a cool mod for this pack or question about modpack?\n- Great! [request](https://discord.gg/x2BfEcQvA4) it \n","2024-09-30T14:17:00.505400Z","2024-11-03T08:57:04.318696Z","2024-10-27T02:26:33.591027Z","2024-10-22T01:24:17.498589Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":3565},403,[77,211],[30,200],[346],[31276,31277,31278,31279,31280],"c7rVTKk0","cfl2D8GU","Mo2JXyTB","l2Lgs7Iy","7G8cx8jw","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpyYVa54/9d39663045fdd04be9be1b69a735bba8567f6d94_96.webp","https://discord.gg/x2BfEcQvA4",[],[],263429,"XEMpiucI",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31288,"id":31289,"slug":31290,"project_type":31,"team":31291,"organization":3565,"title":31292,"description":31293,"body":31294,"body_url":3565,"published":31295,"updated":31296,"approved":31297,"queued":31298,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31299,"downloads":31300,"followers":29998,"categories":31301,"additional_categories":31302,"loaders":31303,"versions":31304,"icon_url":31306,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31307,"gallery":31308,"color":31329,"thread_id":31330,"monetization_status":30007},[628],"krAvTNi5","the-ardium-adventure","YO4BbQ0h","The Ardium Adventure","Ardium and associated items and mobs.","\n# Ardium Adventure: A Minecraft Mod\n\n## The Legend of Ardium\n\nLong before the first blocks were placed and the first torches were lit, before even the Ender Dragon took flight over its obsidian towers, there existed an era of cosmic upheaval known to ancient texts as the Convergence. During this primordial age, the fundamental forces of the Minecraft universe were still in flux, creating conditions that would never again be replicated in the eons to come.\n\nDeep within the earth's mantle, where immense pressure compressed carbon into the crystalline perfection of diamond, something extraordinary occurred. The End dimension, still newly formed and unstable, hemorrhaged fragments of itself into the Overworld through dimensional rifts. Swarms of Endermites—those chittering, purple parasites born from the void between worlds—found themselves thrust into an alien environment of crushing heat and pressure. Rather than perishing, these creatures became entombed alongside veins of forming diamond, their bodies fusing with the gemstones over millions of years in a process of cosmic alchemy.\n\nThe result was Ardium: a material that exists at the intersection of two realms, carrying within its crystalline structure both the indestructible hardness of diamond and the reality-warping essence of the End. The Endermite particles that merged with the diamonds never truly died—they entered a state of suspended animation, their void-energy forever crystallized within the blue-green matrix of this new mineral. This is why Ardium glows faintly in darkness, why tools forged from it seem to cut through stone with supernatural ease, and why the dimension it unlocks feels hauntingly familiar to those who have walked the End's pale islands.\n\n---\n\n## Complete Item Reference\n\n### Raw Materials\n\n| Item | Description | Source |\n|------|-------------|--------|\n| **Ardium Ingot** | The foundational material of the mod, a blue-green crystalline metal infused with dormant Endermite essence | Smelting Ardium Ore or crafting |\n| **Ardium Infused Ardium** | An upgraded tier of Ardium that has been concentrated with additional dimensional energy | Mining Ardium Infused Ardium Ore in the Ardium Dimension |\n\n### Tools\n\n| Tool | Damage | Durability | Efficiency | Special Properties |\n|------|--------|------------|------------|-------------------|\n| **Ardium Pickaxe** | Standard | 100 uses | 400 (extraordinary) | Netherite-tier harvest level; mines through stone and ore at unprecedented speeds |\n| **Ardium Sword** | 400 | 120,000 uses | N/A | Fast attack speed; the crystalline blade hums with contained void-energy |\n| **Ardium Infused Ardium Sword** | 900 | 128,000 uses | N/A | The ultimate melee weapon; forged from material refined in another dimension |\n\n### Armor Set\n\n| Piece | Recipe Cost | Durability Contribution | Properties |\n|-------|-------------|------------------------|------------|\n| **Ardium Helmet** | 5 Ardium Ingots | Part of 15-point total | Enchantability: 9; glows faintly in darkness |\n| **Ardium Chestplate** | 8 Ardium Ingots | Part of 15-point total | Enchantability: 9; provides substantial torso protection |\n| **Ardium Leggings** | 7 Ardium Ingots | Part of 15-point total | Enchantability: 9; allows full mobility |\n| **Ardium Boots** | 4 Ardium Ingots | Part of 15-point total | Enchantability: 9; leaves faint luminescent footprints |\n\n### Special Items\n\n| Item | Recipe | Purpose |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| **Ardium Orb** | 8 Ardium Ingots surrounding 1 Block of Ardium | Dimension igniter; right-click on a portal frame to activate passage to the Ardium Dimension |\n| **Ardium Golem Spawn Egg** | Creative only | Summons an Ardium Golem |\n| **Ardium Cube Spawn Egg** | Creative only | Summons an Ardium Cube |\n| **Ardium Mite Spawn Egg** | Creative only | Summons an Ardium Mite |\n\n---\n\n## Complete Block Reference\n\n### Ore Blocks\n\n| Block | Generation | Tool Required | Drops |\n|-------|------------|---------------|-------|\n| **Ardium Ore** | Overworld, underground | Pickaxe | Ardium Ingot (raw material) |\n| **Ardium Infused Ardium Ore** | Ardium Dimension only | Pickaxe | Ardium Infused Ardium |\n\n### Storage & Decorative Blocks\n\n| Block | Recipe | Properties |\n|-------|--------|------------|\n| **Block of Ardium** | 9 Ardium Ingots (3×3 grid) | Storage block; can be crafted back into 9 ingots; used in Ardium Orb recipe |\n| **Block of Ardium Infused Ardium** | 9 Ardium Infused Ardium (3×3 grid) | Storage block; glowing properties; **serves as portal frame material** |\n| **Ardium Infused Stone** | Found naturally | The primary terrain block of the Ardium Dimension; cannot be crafted |\n| **Ardium Golem Head** | Crafted or dropped | Decorative block with unique front-face texturing; can be placed as decoration |\n\n### Portal Blocks\n\n| Block | Creation Method | Properties |\n|-------|-----------------|------------|\n| **Ardium Dimension Portal** | Activated by using Ardium Orb on Block of Ardium Infused Ardium frame | Emits standard portal particles and ambient portal sounds; transports players to the Ardium Dimension |\n\n---\n\n## Mob Bestiary\n\n### Ardium Golem\n\n*\"The crystalline sentinels that guard Ardium's most sacred deposits, these constructs remember a time before memory.\"*\n\n| Attribute | Value |\n|-----------|-------|\n| **Health** | 10 HP (5 hearts) |\n| **Attack Damage** | 3 |\n| **Attack Knockback** | 0 (no knockback) |\n| **Movement Speed** | 0.3 (slow, lumbering) |\n| **Tracking Range** | 64 blocks |\n| **Follow Range** | 16 blocks |\n| **Category** | Monster |\n| **Spawn Location** | Ardium Dimension |\n\n**Lore:** Born from the concentrated will of countless Endermites fused into Ardium over millennia, the Ardium Golem is not truly alive in any conventional sense. It is an echo of hunger given form—a guardian that protects the dimensional deposits from which it spontaneously emerged. The Golems do not communicate, do not rest, and show no fear. They simply patrol their territory with mechanical precision, attacking any who dare to disturb the sacred ore.\n\n**Combat Behavior:** Ardium Golems are slow but relentless. They will track players from impressive distances and pursue them with single-minded determination. Their attacks lack knockback, meaning victims cannot easily create distance once engaged. The recommended strategy is to maintain range and use hit-and-run tactics, as the Golem's slow movement makes it vulnerable to kiting.\n\n---\n\n### Ardium Cube\n\n*\"A gelatinous mass of crystallized void-energy, bouncing eternally through dimensions without purpose or rest.\"*\n\n| Attribute | Value |\n|-----------|-------|\n| **Health** | 10 HP (5 hearts) |\n| **Attack Damage** | 3 |\n| **Attack Knockback** | 0 |\n| **Movement Speed** | 0.3 |\n| **Tracking Range** | 64 blocks |\n| **Follow Range** | 16 blocks |\n| **Category** | Monster |\n| **Spawn Location** | Ardium Dimension |\n\n**Lore:** When the ancient Endermites fused with diamond under impossible pressure, not all of them found solid form. Some became liquid, their essence pooling together into wobbling masses of semi-sentient gel. The Ardium Cubes are these primordial pools given motion—slime-like entities whose translucent bodies glow with the same eerie light as the ore they were born from. They bounce through the Ardium Dimension's endless expanses, consuming anything organic they encounter.\n\n**Combat Behavior:** Similar to Overworld slimes in movement pattern, Ardium Cubes hop toward their targets with surprising coordination. Their identical stats to Golems make them equally threatening, though their bouncing movement can make them harder to predict. Groups of Cubes can quickly overwhelm unprepared adventurers.\n\n---\n\n### Ardium Mite\n\n*\"The children of the Convergence—descendants of the original Endermites, evolved and enhanced by eons of Ardium exposure.\"*\n\n| Attribute | Value |\n|-----------|-------|\n| **Health** | 10 HP (5 hearts) |\n| **Attack Damage** | 2 |\n| **Attack Knockback** | 0 |\n| **Movement Speed** | 0.3 |\n| **Tracking Range** | 64 blocks |\n| **Follow Range** | 16 blocks |\n| **Category** | Monster |\n| **Spawn Location** | Ardium Dimension |\n\n**Lore:** Unlike the Golems and Cubes—which are manifestations of long-dead Endermites—the Ardium Mites are living creatures. They are the descendants of those ancient parasites that survived the fusion process, their lineage continuing through the countless millennia in the isolation of the Ardium Dimension. Larger than their Overworld ancestors and crackling with crystalline energy, these creatures retain the insatiable hunger and erratic movement patterns of their progenitors.\n\n**Combat Behavior:** Ardium Mites deal slightly less damage than their Golem and Cube counterparts, making them the least threatening individual enemy. However, their small size and tendency to appear in numbers make them dangerous through accumulated damage. They represent an evolved form of the original Endermites whose fusion created Ardium itself—a living link to the mod's ancient lore.\n\n---\n\n## The Ardium Dimension\n\n### Dimension Characteristics\n\n| Property | Value |\n|----------|-------|\n| **Height** | 128 blocks |\n| **Primary Terrain** | Ardium Infused Stone |\n| **Biome** | Ardiumbiome (unique to dimension) |\n| **Sky** | None (void rendering) |\n| **Clouds** | Disabled |\n| **Fog** | Disabled |\n| **Time Cycle** | Fixed |\n| **Water** | Fluid layer present |\n| **Ore Generation** | Ardium Infused Ardium Ore veins |\n| **Mob Spawning** | Ardium Golem, Ardium Cube, Ardium Mite |\n| **Respawn Allowed** | No (must return via portal) |\n\n### Accessing the Dimension\n\n1. **Mine Ardium Ore** in the Overworld to gather initial supplies\n2. **Craft Ardium Ingots** and consolidate into Blocks of Ardium\n3. **Progress to Ardium Infused Ardium** (requires initial dimension access or alternative method)\n4. **Build a portal frame** using Blocks of Ardium Infused Ardium\n5. **Craft the Ardium Orb** (8 Ardium Ingots + 1 Block of Ardium, center)\n6. **Activate the portal** by right-clicking the frame with the Ardium Orb\n7. **Step through** and prepare for combat\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Reference\n\n### Recipes Quick Guide\n\n| Output | Ingredients | Pattern |\n|--------|-------------|---------|\n| Block of Ardium | 9 Ardium Ingots | Full 3×3 grid |\n| Block of Ardium Infused Ardium | 9 Ardium Infused Ardium | Full 3×3 grid |\n| Ardium Pickaxe | 3 Ardium + 2 Sticks | Pickaxe pattern (3 top, 2 vertical center) |\n| Ardium Sword | 2 Ardium + 1 Stick | Sword pattern (2 vertical + 1 handle) |\n| Ardium Infused Ardium Sword | 2 Ardium Infused Ardium + 1 Stick | Sword pattern |\n| Ardium Helmet | 5 Ardium Ingots | Helmet pattern |\n| Ardium Chestplate | 8 Ardium Ingots | Chestplate pattern |\n| Ardium Leggings | 7 Ardium Ingots | Leggings pattern |\n| Ardium Boots | 4 Ardium Ingots | Boots pattern |\n| Ardium Orb | 8 Ardium + 1 Block of Ardium | Ring of ingots around center block |\n\n---\n\n## Progression Summary\n\n**Early Game** → Mine Ardium Ore, craft basic tools and armor\n**Mid Game** → Equip full Ardium set, craft the Ardium Orb\n**Late Game** → Enter the Ardium Dimension, battle its guardians\n**End Game** → Acquire Ardium Infused Ardium, forge ultimate weapons\n\nThe journey from first Ardium discovery to wielding the devastating Ardium Infused Ardium Sword represents a complete adventure arc—one that takes players from the familiar depths of the Overworld to the haunting expanses of a dimension born from an era-spanning fusion of diamond and Endermite. Your adventure awaits.","2026-03-31T17:06:11.455114Z","2026-03-31T17:15:23.338419Z","2026-04-11T21:24:31.492273Z","2026-03-31T17:25:32.553577Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},15,[],[],[385],[31305],"NhXDHFCw","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krAvTNi5/2570501ba7ee01a1c5ba0c154b1bd49de570d635_96.webp",[],[31309,31314,31319,31324],{"url":31310,"raw_url":31311,"featured":439,"title":31312,"description":3565,"created":31313,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krAvTNi5/images/2712e4e2bdef976ae92581f1fd57378d9521ecda_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krAvTNi5/images/2712e4e2bdef976ae92581f1fd57378d9521ecda.png","Block of ardium","2026-03-31T17:17:45.858804Z",{"url":31315,"raw_url":31316,"featured":439,"title":31317,"description":3565,"created":31318,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krAvTNi5/images/f03f1b9f15365d9e83106a380ee2c5925b9c595e_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krAvTNi5/images/f03f1b9f15365d9e83106a380ee2c5925b9c595e.png","Ardium Ore","2026-03-31T17:17:55.554461Z",{"url":31320,"raw_url":31321,"featured":439,"title":31322,"description":3565,"created":31323,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krAvTNi5/images/f0debc6de78bfd6afad598e5f5060a9df01b909b_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krAvTNi5/images/f0debc6de78bfd6afad598e5f5060a9df01b909b.png","Block of ardium infused ardium","2026-03-31T17:17:36.702273Z",{"url":31325,"raw_url":31326,"featured":439,"title":31327,"description":3565,"created":31328,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krAvTNi5/images/fe2d7555a94298a18e7f389c31e2b6280efd20e1_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krAvTNi5/images/fe2d7555a94298a18e7f389c31e2b6280efd20e1.png","Ardium infused ardium ore","2026-03-31T17:18:08.703243Z",4197412,"SSq8we9a",{"client_side":30119,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31332,"id":31333,"slug":31334,"project_type":31,"team":31335,"organization":3565,"title":31336,"description":31337,"body":31338,"body_url":3565,"published":31339,"updated":31340,"approved":31341,"queued":31342,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31343,"downloads":31344,"followers":30023,"categories":31345,"additional_categories":31346,"loaders":31347,"versions":31348,"icon_url":31351,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31352,"gallery":31355,"color":31380,"thread_id":31381,"monetization_status":30007},[1013,1010,1007,1004,1001,983,980,977,974,971,968,965,962,959,956,953,950,947,941,935,932,929,926,923,920,917,914,911,908,905,902,899,896,893,887,884,881,878,875,872,869,866,863,857,854,851,848,845,842,839,836,833,830,827,824,820,814,811,808,805,802,799,796,793,790,787,784,766,763,760,757,754,733,685,643,634,628,583,577,532],"krKCyXg2","anis-fakemon-cobblemon","EqNhCot1","Ani's fakemon cobblemon","Adds 4 pokemon in total, 1 evolution line of 3 fakemon and 1 eevee evolution","### This datapack currently adds in 4 new fakemon\nCurrent pokemon added:\n- Glasmol (water/poison) uncommon spawn at beach biome\n- Glacidrake (water/dragon) rare spawn at beach biome\n- Dratlantic (water/dragon) ultra rare spawn at beach biome\n- Knighteon (Steel) rare spawn at villages and strongholds, evolves from eevee after right clicking on one with an iron sword in your hand\n\n2 of them can be used as a submarine type mounts.\nI intend on expand this addon overtime whenever I get new ideas for fakemon so expect more in the future, I aim to prioritize quality over quantity.\n\nServer use is okay if I'm given credits somewhere and the Pokémon are not put behind paywalls (subscriptions, donations, season passes, etc.)\n\n### HOW TO INSTALL\nCopy and paste the addon's .zip file into your resourcepack and datapack folders (if using something like Global Packs)\n\nIf the prior method doesn't work copy and paste the addon's zip file into your resource pack folder, then enter the game, make a new world, go to the datapack tab and paste it into the world's datapack folder too.","2026-03-21T21:23:16.858362Z","2026-05-21T00:05:43.117431Z","2026-03-22T04:35:58.651554Z","2026-03-21T23:43:07.627300Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":3565},99,[191],[134,303],[342],[31349,31350],"kvFcNdxz","Db3TCnQc","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krKCyXg2/ea813d53d6f0974eb4887aeac21306fee3ed7078.png",[31353],{"id":3122,"platform":3123,"url":31354},"https://ko-fi.com/anithepossum",[31356,31362,31368,31374],{"url":31357,"raw_url":31358,"featured":439,"title":31359,"description":31360,"created":31361,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krKCyXg2/images/00631f100227ba9a0167af7cc007dc627190a06d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krKCyXg2/images/00631f100227ba9a0167af7cc007dc627190a06d.png","Knighteon","New steel type eevee evolution, evolves when right clicking on eevee with an iron sword on your hand","2026-05-21T00:08:56.620493Z",{"url":31363,"raw_url":31364,"featured":439,"title":31365,"description":31366,"created":31367,"ordering":29979},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krKCyXg2/images/4100d598d72e5e52b64d689f5c2ce34d7a9ff5bf_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krKCyXg2/images/4100d598d72e5e52b64d689f5c2ce34d7a9ff5bf.png","Glasmol","First in its evolution line, found at beach biomes","2026-03-21T23:40:43.953411Z",{"url":31369,"raw_url":31370,"featured":439,"title":31371,"description":31372,"created":31373,"ordering":30023},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krKCyXg2/images/38b15d00855e94141237c0007a9b1f91e6353318_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krKCyXg2/images/38b15d00855e94141237c0007a9b1f91e6353318.png","Glacidrake","Evolves from Glasmol at level 20","2026-03-21T23:41:19.303501Z",{"url":31375,"raw_url":31376,"featured":822,"title":31377,"description":31378,"created":31379,"ordering":30465},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krKCyXg2/images/f88527d12019e4eca42f70f6d7d185e059803b3d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krKCyXg2/images/f88527d12019e4eca42f70f6d7d185e059803b3d.png","Dratlantic","Evolves from Glacidrake at level 40","2026-03-21T23:41:42.053437Z",929625,"xBMaqOVB",{"client_side":29964,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31383,"id":31384,"slug":31385,"project_type":31,"team":31386,"organization":3565,"title":31387,"description":31388,"body":31389,"body_url":3565,"published":31390,"updated":31391,"approved":31392,"queued":31393,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31394,"downloads":31395,"followers":29979,"categories":31396,"additional_categories":31397,"loaders":31398,"versions":31399,"icon_url":31401,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31402,"gallery":31403,"color":31409,"thread_id":31410,"monetization_status":30007},[733,685,643,634,628,583,577,532],"kqiz6z6B","jail-jp","HvYi7b4Y","Jail 牢獄","Jail plugin for Paper. Jails specified players and prevents jailbreaks. / Paper用の牢獄プラグイン。指定したプレイヤーを投獄、脱獄対策","## 日本語は以下にあります↓\n\nSimple and easy-to-use jail plugin.\n\nThis plugin is perfect for exposing guilty players without banning them.\n\nJapanese only! Sorry ^^;\n\n![Prison Image](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae0b3c09fcd99897f27c68bddc76c60227491193.jpeg)\n\n# Basic Features\n\n✅ Set jail coordinates and radius\n\n✅ Automatically release players to the set coordinates after their sentence expires\n\n✅ Teleport players after spawning, even offline players\n\n✅ Return players if they exceed the specified radius\n\n✅ IP-based sub-account protection\n\n✅ Periodic messages to imprisoned players\n\n✅ Easy-to-read list of imprisoned players\n\nSub-accounts are identified based on their IP address and automatically imprisoned.\n\nSafe even for offline mode servers.\n\n# Command List \nPermission: jail.admin)¥\n\n`/setjail \u003Cradius>` Sets the jail radius around your current coordinates.\n\n`/setrelease` Sets your current location to the location you will be teleported to upon release.\n\n`/sethologram` Spawns a list of imprisoned people.\n\n`/jail \u003Cplayer name>` \u003Csentence length> \u003Creason> Command to imprison.\n\n`/unjail \u003Cplayer name>` Command to release.\n\n---\n\nシンプルで使いやすい牢獄プラグインです。\n\n罪を犯したプレイヤーをBANせずに晒し者にするには最適なプラグインです。\n\n\n日本語にのみ対応しています / Japanese Only! Sorry ^^;\n\n![牢獄の様子](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae0b3c09fcd99897f27c68bddc76c60227491193.jpeg)\n\n# 基本的な機能\n\n✅ 監獄の座標と半径を設定可能\n\n✅ 刑期が過ぎると自動的に設定した座標に釈放されます\n\n✅ オフラインのプレイヤーであってもスポーン後にテレポートされます\n\n✅ 指定された半径を超えたら戻されます\n\n✅ IPベースのサブアカウント対策\n\n✅ 投獄者への定期的なメッセージ\n\n✅ 見やすい投獄者一覧表\n\n\n\nIPを元にサブアカウントを判定し、自動的に投獄します。\n\nオフラインモードのサーバーでも安心です。\n\n# コマンド一覧 \n権限: jail.admin\n\n`/setjail \u003C半径>`  自分がいる座標を中心に、指定した半径で牢屋の範囲を設定します\n\n`/setrelease`  自分がいる場所を釈放時にテレポートされる場所に設定します\n\n`/sethologram`  投獄されている人の一覧表をスポーンさせます\n\n`/jail \u003Cプレイヤー名>` \u003C刑期> \u003C理由>  投獄するコマンド\n\n`/unjail \u003Cプレイヤー名>`  釈放するコマンド","2026-03-01T10:42:14.672744Z","2026-03-01T11:40:52.726441Z","2026-03-12T08:40:30.647281Z","2026-03-10T09:07:47.608390Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":3565},40,[175],[],[401],[31400],"Fm4a4J6b","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqiz6z6B/38e0df85c298a3b05161530c59cc4b5910878e4a_96.webp",[],[31404],{"url":31405,"raw_url":31406,"featured":439,"title":31407,"description":3565,"created":31408,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqiz6z6B/images/ae0b3c09fcd99897f27c68bddc76c60227491193_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqiz6z6B/images/ae0b3c09fcd99897f27c68bddc76c60227491193.jpeg","牢獄の様子","2026-03-01T11:09:30.095308Z",13158341,"yPiij4L1",{"client_side":29964,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31412,"id":31413,"slug":31414,"project_type":31,"team":31415,"organization":3565,"title":31416,"description":31417,"body":31418,"body_url":3565,"published":31419,"updated":31420,"approved":31421,"queued":31422,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31423,"downloads":31425,"followers":29998,"categories":31426,"additional_categories":31427,"loaders":31428,"versions":31429,"icon_url":31436,"issues_url":31437,"source_url":31438,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31439,"gallery":31440,"color":31447,"thread_id":31448,"monetization_status":30007},[820,814,628,577],"krlfhrq6","choosedeath","2fq2UWXA","ChooseDeath","A plugin that lets your players choose the difficulty of their deaths","# ![logo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e2abfedd0e9575ecae3e0821fe5a56eb628e86ec.png) Choose Death\n\nThis plugin allows player to choose of more or less difficult death. Great for SMPs with a mix of new and veteran players !\n\n### Death Difficulties\n- **PEACEFUL:** \n  - Keep items and experience points\n  - Respawn at last respawn point\n- **EASY:**\n  - Creates a private grave at death location\n  - Respawn at last respawn point\n  - _**Note: If the server is in Peaceful mode, grave won't spawn, and you will lose all your items**_\n- **NORMAL:**\n  - Normal Minecraft death\n- **HARD:**\n  - Lose items and experience points\n  - Respawn at last respawn point\n- **HARDCORE:**\n  - Lose items and experience points\n  - Respawn at world spawn\n\n### Commands\n- `/choosedeath reload` : Reloads plugin\n    - _permission : `choosedeath.commands.reload`_\n- `/choosedeath open` : Opens up the menu to change your death difficulty\n  - _permission : `choosedeath.commands.open`_\n- `/choosedeath set \u003CDeathDifficulty> [\u003CPlayer>]` : Change your death difficulty\n  - _permission : `choosedeath.commands.set`_\n  - _permission : `choosedeath.commands.set.target` for setting other players difficulty_\n- `/choosedeath setitem \u003CDeathDifficulty>` : Change the menu item for a set difficulty\n  - _permission : `choosedeath.commands.setitem`_\n\n### Disclaimer\nThis is my first ever released plugin. It's real bare bones for now but I plan on adding stuff in the future.\nAlso, the code is open source so feel free to take a look and propose changes !\n\n\n### Screenshot\n\n![screenshot](https://codeberg.org/ImNootingHere/ChooseDeath/raw/branch/2.0/src/main/resources/screenshot.png)\n\n\n\n \n\n## Authors\n\n- [@ImNootingHere](https://codeberg.org/ImNootingHere)\n\n\n## License\n\n[MIT](https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/)","2024-08-24T19:14:43.076158Z","2025-11-01T13:26:40.589316Z","2024-08-26T01:42:44.411736Z","2024-08-24T20:18:59.373525Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":31424},"https://codeberg.org/ImNootingHere/ChooseDeath/src/branch/master/LICENCE.md",119,[134],[303],[401],[31430,31431,31432,31433,31434,31435],"GuHjldf0","8Q6528er","n3IJ99yV","nnZjJmo8","1rPnt8mF","hNAcJVvn","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krlfhrq6/e2abfedd0e9575ecae3e0821fe5a56eb628e86ec.png","https://codeberg.org/ImNootingHere/ChooseDeath/issues","https://codeberg.org/ImNootingHere/ChooseDeath",[],[31441],{"url":31442,"raw_url":31443,"featured":439,"title":31444,"description":31445,"created":31446,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krlfhrq6/images/659c59076e590c98aa6549939b65960d86fbca75_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krlfhrq6/images/659c59076e590c98aa6549939b65960d86fbca75.png","Screenshot","The ChooseDeath menu","2025-11-01T13:41:00.645337Z",3421236,"GZcDMUVH",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31450,"id":31451,"slug":31452,"project_type":31,"team":31453,"organization":3565,"title":31454,"description":31455,"body":31456,"body_url":3565,"published":31457,"updated":31458,"approved":31459,"queued":31460,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31461,"downloads":31462,"followers":29998,"categories":31463,"additional_categories":31464,"loaders":31465,"versions":31466,"icon_url":31469,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31470,"gallery":31473,"color":31474,"thread_id":31475,"monetization_status":30007},[814],"kqDKmgda","wax-instead","UylmXEpG","Wax Instead","Tired of using full honeycombs just to wax something? Fear not, you can now make wax!","Turn honeycombs into hard wax (x3), smelt the hard wax to get a useable wax! \n\n**Requires Fabric API.**\n\n \n\nThe usable wax can be used directly on coppper to wax it, or in a crafting table with copper blocks, just like honeycombs.   \nOne honeycomb now yields two candles (when using wax as a replacement), with one wax leftover.\n\nThe candle recipe for wax is two wax stacked on top of each other, with a string on top of them, it yields two candles.\n\n*   String\n*   Wax\n*   Wax\n\n## **Developers**\n\nWax also introduces a few new tags: __waxmod:waxes__ (all waxes in all of their states + honeycomb), __waxmod:softwaxes__ (only smelted/soft waxes), __waxmod:hardwaxes__ \n\nUsing tags is recommended for any mod adding compatibility as there will likely be new waxes added in the future.   \n  \n\nAll vanilla recipes for waxing accept the #waxmod:waxes tag.","2025-09-03T20:36:59.167357Z","2025-09-08T13:58:36.791200Z","2025-09-07T04:06:43.566848Z","2025-09-03T20:41:57.533278Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},1397,[303],[],[346],[31467,31468],"da59cP7x","43KoSFWW","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqDKmgda/4701af51f84c989ee38d4d49804523f9005cb0e6.png",[31471],{"id":3122,"platform":3123,"url":31472},"https://www.ko-fi.com/dessence",[],14381864,"Yh4TWDN9",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29964,"game_versions":31477,"id":31478,"slug":31479,"project_type":31,"team":31480,"organization":3565,"title":31481,"description":31482,"body":31483,"body_url":3565,"published":31484,"updated":31485,"approved":31484,"queued":3565,"status":29951,"requested_status":3565,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31486,"downloads":31487,"followers":31488,"categories":31489,"additional_categories":31490,"loaders":31491,"versions":31492,"icon_url":31504,"issues_url":31505,"source_url":31506,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31507,"gallery":31508,"color":31509,"thread_id":31478,"monetization_status":30007},[1367,1349,1286,1271,1244,1187,1154,1145,1109,1070,1022,1016,983,941,935,857,820,814,763,733,685,643,634,628,577,532,478,472,459],"kqJFAPU9","better-mount-hud","xIEuGYOS","Better Mount HUD","Improves the ingame HUD while riding a mount","This client-side mod improves the ingame HUD while riding a horse, donkey or other mount.\n\n### Features\n- Both your food and the health of your mount is displayed at the same time\n- The experience bar only gets replaced with the jump bar while actually jumping\n","2021-11-21T14:06:31.826745Z","2026-03-23T20:42:34.006015Z",{"id":30020,"name":30021,"url":3565},17112875,2142,[303],[],[346],[31493,31494,31495,31496,31497,31498,31499,31500,31501,31502,31503],"LY3JHymB","mTzmPw2C","MjGehyF4","pRNvuggg","wqS80NMj","h1QpxElt","B4fnGV1X","yyJushgo","GGWgvqjm","rXZxHSEZ","b08SuUDz","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqJFAPU9/2347cd97d4d4a5f87842dccebd8eba211d77d37a_96.webp","https://github.com/Lortseam/better-mount-hud/issues","https://github.com/Lortseam/better-mount-hud",[],[],389381,{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31511,"id":31512,"slug":31513,"project_type":31,"team":31514,"organization":3565,"title":31515,"description":31516,"body":31517,"body_url":3565,"published":31518,"updated":31519,"approved":31520,"queued":31521,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31522,"downloads":31523,"followers":30023,"categories":31524,"additional_categories":31525,"loaders":31526,"versions":31527,"icon_url":31530,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":31531,"donation_urls":31532,"gallery":31535,"color":31556,"thread_id":31557,"monetization_status":30007},[1016,935],"kqWbyPbk","just-glowing-buttons","iqA935O9","Just Glowing Buttons","These 16 Colored Buttons Glows/Emits Light. Best To Use With Shaders.","### **Just Glowing Buttons** adds 16 colored buttons that glows or emits light. These buttons will look better if you use shaders.\n### These Buttons can be use in decorations as well.\n\n---\n\n_Currently Available For: Forge-1.20.1 & NeoForge-1.20.4_\n_Other versions' support are on the way!_","2024-05-27T18:08:51.111570Z","2024-05-27T18:35:40.448918Z","2024-05-29T05:16:17.194289Z","2024-05-27T18:50:16.898630Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":3565},619,[100,288],[],[354,385],[31528,31529],"YEXcVW5y","k8cDL308","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqWbyPbk/4b61c17383fd8a3b41d11e21768c1c6381317785_96.webp","https://discord.gg/d2V77j5CeE",[31533],{"id":3113,"platform":30631,"url":31534},"https://buymeacoffee.com/smilelulz",[31536,31541,31546,31551],{"url":31537,"raw_url":31538,"featured":822,"title":31539,"description":3565,"created":31540,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqWbyPbk/images/04463840b50108e459a86086b4c4fe1ba3e4a01b_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqWbyPbk/images/976caadf8d9174c9ff669b77a7d53d92023aa26f.png","White","2024-05-27T18:39:35.468533Z",{"url":31542,"raw_url":31543,"featured":439,"title":31544,"description":3565,"created":31545,"ordering":29979},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqWbyPbk/images/4888b6f17e7c1cfa3161d4914952abef0a3ab419_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqWbyPbk/images/4888b6f17e7c1cfa3161d4914952abef0a3ab419.png","Red","2024-05-27T18:40:02.721474Z",{"url":31547,"raw_url":31548,"featured":439,"title":31549,"description":3565,"created":31550,"ordering":30023},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqWbyPbk/images/4f85d3b1f0d192d51458fa2e599349991ce9dc90_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqWbyPbk/images/4f85d3b1f0d192d51458fa2e599349991ce9dc90.png","Lime","2024-05-27T18:40:29.394157Z",{"url":31552,"raw_url":31553,"featured":439,"title":31554,"description":3565,"created":31555,"ordering":30465},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqWbyPbk/images/2462020755f8935d89f08d6d908d48e47e92fbe2_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqWbyPbk/images/2462020755f8935d89f08d6d908d48e47e92fbe2.png","3/16 Buttons","2024-05-27T18:41:42.816794Z",2915484,"CS4X5wmM",{"client_side":29964,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31559,"id":31560,"slug":31561,"project_type":31,"team":31562,"organization":3565,"title":31563,"description":31564,"body":31565,"body_url":3565,"published":31566,"updated":31567,"approved":31568,"queued":31569,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31570,"downloads":31571,"followers":30023,"categories":31572,"additional_categories":31573,"loaders":31574,"versions":31575,"icon_url":31578,"issues_url":31579,"source_url":31580,"wiki_url":31581,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31582,"gallery":31583,"color":31599,"thread_id":31600,"monetization_status":30007},[820,814,766,763,733,685,643,634,628],"kqi1X5kZ","random-drop","xo49htjb","Random Drop","This is a plugin that gives the players a random weapon or armor drop, meant for tournament purposes.","Drops is a modular loot drop plugin for Minecraft 1.21+, designed to deliver randomized gear, tools, and consumables to players every 30 seconds. Items are selected from a weighted pool, making rare drops like Netherite gear or Enchanted Golden Apples feel truly mythic. Each drop cycle is announced globally, adding a cinematic layer to your server’s atmosphere.\nPerfect for survival servers, tournaments, or lore-driven worlds, Drops requires no setup—just install and go. It’s built with Maven and the Spigot API, making it easy to expand with custom effects, lore overlays, or config support.\nCommands:\n- /startdrops — Begins the drop cycle\n- /stopdrops — Ends the drop cycle\nCurrent loot includes:\n- Weapons: Wooden to Netherite swords\n- Tools: Stone to Netherite axes\n- Armor: Full sets from Leather to Netherite\n- Consumables: Golden Apples and Enchanted Golden Apples\nDrops is lightweight, mythic-friendly, and ready to be customized. Whether you want to escalate chaos or reward exploration, this plugin adds a dynamic rhythm to your world.\n","2025-08-09T23:23:14.913373Z","2025-08-22T21:23:44.222261Z","2025-08-12T02:22:20.123247Z","2025-08-09T23:39:31.531320Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},89,[115,134,175],[303],[329,401],[31576,31577],"klw7DUyl","Versn9Jn","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqi1X5kZ/f2e2199e0e8341fadbf11470afc6e6d3dd6116c2_96.webp","https://github.com/Gamecat9999/Random-Drops-/issues","https://github.com/Gamecat9999/Random-Drops-","https://drops.pages.dev/",[],[31584,31589,31594],{"url":31585,"raw_url":31585,"featured":822,"title":31586,"description":31587,"created":31588,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqi1X5kZ/images/1c98051747fe153022b135641be0d92437eb9c16.png","Started Drops","This is what it looks like when the drops are started and when the drops are given","2025-08-09T23:28:59.344148Z",{"url":31590,"raw_url":31590,"featured":439,"title":31591,"description":31592,"created":31593,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqi1X5kZ/images/d6b1065616334ab1ce0abeaddd7c87d08928c4c9.png","Stop Drops","This is what it looks like when drops are stopped.","2025-08-09T23:29:19.865846Z",{"url":31595,"raw_url":31595,"featured":439,"title":31596,"description":31597,"created":31598,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqi1X5kZ/images/de598d8038105bbae549a32ab68777b2be5d476d.png","Start Drops","this is the start drops command","2025-08-09T23:28:24.138838Z",3907513,"bM9LRymm",{"client_side":29964,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31602,"id":31603,"slug":31604,"project_type":31,"team":31605,"organization":3565,"title":31606,"description":31607,"body":31608,"body_url":3565,"published":31609,"updated":31610,"approved":31611,"queued":31612,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31613,"downloads":31616,"followers":30023,"categories":31617,"additional_categories":31618,"loaders":31619,"versions":31620,"icon_url":31629,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":31630,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31631,"gallery":31632,"color":31633,"thread_id":31634,"monetization_status":30007},[814],"krPhIQKY","cobblemon-wild-loot","a4F6h9us","Cobblemon: Wild Loot","A Cobblemon mod that gives Pokémon a chance to drop items passively not just in pastures, but the wild and in your party too.","# Cobblemon: Wild Loot\nA Cobblemon mod that gives Pokémon a chance to randomly drop items from their loot tables at their current location. Unlike similar mods, it works with wild Pokémon and party Pokémon (so long as they are let out of their pokéballs) too!\n\nAdds a new storage block, the Pokébasket, which automatically collects passive Pokémon drops within a configurable (default 12) block radius. It can be crafted with any 4 apricorns of any color and 3 sticks.\n\n![Crafting recipe for a Pokébasket.](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ca74e8c2b08836f2beb9584a95062c33b368d16e.png)\n\n## Credits\n- Based on [Cobblemon Pasture Loot](https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-pasture-loot).\n- Uses basket model from Farmer's Delight.\n\n## Dependencies\n- [Cobblemon](https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon)\n- [Architectury API](https://modrinth.com/mod/architectury-api)\n\n## Configuration\nYou can edit the config file at `config/CobblemonWildLoot.json` to change settings.\n- `tick_per_minute`: The number of ticks per minute. Should stay at 1200 unless you change the game's tick rate to a value other than the default `20`.\n- `drop_chance_per_minute`: The default chance for each Pokémon to drop loot is a 5% chance per minute.\n- `pokebasket_block_radius`: Distance in blocks at which Pokébaskets will automatically collect items from nearby Pokémon.\n- `item_blacklist`: A list of items that should not be dropped by Pokémon.\n```json\n{\n  \"tick_per_minute\": 1200,\n  \"drop_chance_per_minute\": 0.05,\n  \"pokebasket_block_radius\": 12,\n  \"item_blacklist\": [\n    \"minecraft:porkchop\",\n    \"minecraft:beef\",\n    \"minecraft:chicken\",\n    \"minecraft:mutton\",\n    \"minecraft:rabbit\",\n    \"minecraft:fish\",\n    \"minecraft:cooked_porkchop\",\n    \"minecraft:cooked_beef\",\n    \"minecraft:cooked_chicken\",\n    \"minecraft:cooked_mutton\",\n    \"minecraft:cooked_rabbit\",\n    \"minecraft:cooked_fish\",\n    \"minecraft:leather\",\n    \"minecraft:bone\",\n    \"minecraft:spider_eye\",\n    \"minecraft:rotten_flesh\",\n    \"minecraft:rabbit_hide\",\n    \"minecraft:rabbit_foot\",\n    \"minecraft:cod\",\n    \"minecraft:pufferfish\",\n    \"minecraft:bone_block\",\n    \"minecraft:bone_meal\",\n    \"cobblemon:sharp_beak\",\n    \"minecraft:honey_bottle\",\n    \"minecraft:salmon\",\n    \"minecraft:white_wool\"\n  ]\n}\n```","2026-04-01T04:13:20.557076Z","2026-04-22T15:21:09.040164Z","2026-04-13T03:59:25.789611Z","2026-04-01T15:17:51.395504Z",{"id":31614,"name":31615,"url":3565},"AGPL-3.0-or-later","GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later",439,[303],[134,191],[346,385],[31621,31622,31623,31624,31625,31626,31627,31628],"kcW9yUre","BY0W7Bqa","XgVIzzQ1","1wInYIdi","84UEXiqW","FsSUfWOl","BdvPCqU8","a1b5hKzm","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krPhIQKY/6c24deb9aff7e00c38b66e01e87a87f4b12ab483_96.webp","https://github.com/lucyawrey/CobblemonWildLoot",[],[],4535845,"ij56xyrj",{"client_side":30119,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31636,"id":31637,"slug":31638,"project_type":31,"team":31639,"organization":3565,"title":31640,"description":31641,"body":31642,"body_url":3565,"published":31643,"updated":31644,"approved":31645,"queued":31646,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31647,"downloads":31648,"followers":29979,"categories":31649,"additional_categories":31650,"loaders":31651,"versions":31652,"icon_url":31654,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":31655,"gallery":31656,"color":31663,"thread_id":31664,"monetization_status":30007},[1022,1016],"krWRdqk9","poisoneer","IzVW0baI","Poisoneer","An Origin datapack that ands Poisoneer to the game","## Passives\n\n### Ratling \n- You are 15% smaller and take 40% more damage when being hit by someone who has more than 18 hp.\n\n### Shadow magic \n- If you are sneaking you cover yourself with shadows and gain true invisibility, that hides you even if you are glowing. You move slower and automatically destroy torches around you If you stop sneaking but not moving you are still invisible.\n\n### Rapid movement\n- You move faster than an ordinary human, when you sprint you gradually increase your movement speed and jump height even more. When you are drawing your bow you are not losing speed.\n\n### Poisoned arrows\n- Your damage with arrows is set to 1 but your arrows inflict poison on your targets for 10 seconds. Each time you hit a target that already has a poison effect, the poison effect will increase its level by 1. Undead targets instead get wither effect.\n\n### Cursed touch\n- Your melee attacks apply curse on your targets, making them more vulnerable to magic, withering, hunger and poison damage. Each stack increases damage taken by 25%. The maximum amount of stacks is 20. Target loses 2 stacks every 10 seconds if it hasn't been hit. Decreases healing target takes by 25% for each 5 stacks\n\n### Clumsy\n- You can't use axes, getting hit prevents you from using bows for 10 seconds and you gain a clumsy stack every time you hit someone. Each stack decreases damage you deal by 15% and if you hit someone when you have 5 stacks your weapon will slip out of your hand and you will return to 2 stacks. If you kill your target you lose all stacks.\n \n## Active abilities: \n\n### [Primary] Disarming attack \n- Lunge forward, disarming opponent on the next hit.\n-#Disarmed opponents deal no damage and get 1 additional curse stack when hit for next 5 seconds.\n\n### [Secondary] Dark bomb \n- Deploy a magic bomb on the creature you are aiming at, rooting it for 3 seconds. After 12 seconds it will explode dealing 4 magic damage.\n","2025-09-29T22:34:17.789828Z","2025-09-29T22:35:47.032315Z","2025-09-30T05:36:51.221022Z","2025-09-29T22:43:20.872412Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},17,[],[],[342],[31653],"cgEqWqAz","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krWRdqk9/20b690db805171ebe3333ef0d90f5a083e19b1e3_96.webp",[],[31657],{"url":31658,"raw_url":31659,"featured":439,"title":31660,"description":31661,"created":31662,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krWRdqk9/images/e0b7bf86ddb2a53728bdc1fc9e55d463f8fc982b_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krWRdqk9/images/e0b7bf86ddb2a53728bdc1fc9e55d463f8fc982b.png","Decide","Slow and painful","2025-09-29T22:34:49.668441Z",5787219,"RqNYLrqH",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":31666,"id":31667,"slug":31668,"project_type":34,"team":31669,"organization":3565,"title":31670,"description":31671,"body":31672,"body_url":3565,"published":31673,"updated":31674,"approved":31675,"queued":31676,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31677,"downloads":30374,"followers":29998,"categories":31678,"additional_categories":31679,"loaders":31680,"versions":31681,"icon_url":3565,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":31684,"donation_urls":31685,"gallery":31686,"color":3565,"thread_id":31687,"monetization_status":30007},[1016],"kr7jtm6C","garse-minecraft","BHE7eGTA","GARSE MC","Official modpack for the GARSE Minecraft server. Fabric 1.20.1 with Create, Farmer's Delight, BlueMap, and more.","# GARSE MC\n\nOfficial modpack for the GARSE community server.\n\n## Included Mods\n\n- **Create** - Mechanical contraptions and automation\n- **Farmer's Delight** - Cooking and farming expansion\n- **BlueMap** - Live 3D web map\n- **Steam 'n' Rails** - Extended train system\n- **WorldEdit** - Building tools\n- **Flan** - Land claiming\n- **Lithium/FerriteCore** - Performance optimization\n- And 22 more!\n\n## Server Info\n\n- **IP:** 64.20.48.82:25565\n- **Version:** Fabric 1.20.1\n- **Discord:** [discord.gg/garse](https://discord.gg/garse)\n\n## Installation\n\n1. Download the [Modrinth App](https://modrinth.com/app) or use Prism Launcher\n2. Search for **GARSE MC** or click Install\n3. Connect to 64.20.48.82:25565\n\nThat's it. See you in-game.","2026-03-18T02:16:50.936082Z","2026-03-19T03:25:22.757033Z","2026-04-09T19:51:21.724704Z","2026-03-18T02:23:05.430615Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},[30,288],[],[346],[31682,31683],"W7trM5MQ","1xrQo4Fn","https://discord.gg/garse",[],[],"JfJWaEr9",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29964,"game_versions":31689,"id":31690,"slug":31691,"project_type":31,"team":31692,"organization":3565,"title":31693,"description":31694,"body":31695,"body_url":3565,"published":31696,"updated":31697,"approved":31698,"queued":31699,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":31700,"downloads":31703,"followers":30023,"categories":31704,"additional_categories":31705,"loaders":31706,"versions":31707,"icon_url":31709,"issues_url":31710,"source_url":31711,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":31712,"donation_urls":31713,"gallery":31714,"color":31721,"thread_id":31722,"monetization_status":30007},[532],"kptzCiEI","cockpit","qFTfdYdN","Cockpit","Turn your wings into a 737 | Elytra HUD","# Cockpit\nCockpit is a Minecraft mod designed to make controlling the Elytra feel like a flight simulator. With smart guide lines, info meters, and renders, you'll accel at flying with or without rockets.\n\n![feature image](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/26db2b839e82ee607d01769f6ec68a183f6d14a2_0.webp)\n\n## Features\n- Info display (Pitch, speed)\n- Pitch guidelines\n- Magnetic pitch (smooth snap pitch)\n- Time since last firework rocket\n- Fancy speed graph\n- Stall and Dive warnings\n- 3D Player render","2026-02-16T03:26:12.672195Z","2026-02-16T03:45:54.998971Z","2026-02-16T09:05:08.504825Z","2026-02-16T03:57:38.647578Z",{"id":31701,"name":31702,"url"