35,863,857,820],"kqc8wQyk","glsl-panorama","YnfHEQKN","GLSL Panorama Shaders","This mod allows resource packs to add GLSL shaders for the title screen panorama","# GLSL Panorama Shaders\n\nThis mod allows resource packs to add shaders for the title screen panorama!  \nThis mod requires **Fabric API**, you can configure the panorama shaders (change quality, disable/enable) using the \"settings\" button in **Mod Menu** or by pressing **F5** while on the title screen.  \nThe shaders are loaded from resource packs, for more info on how to make one see the wiki page. You got questions or need help? Visit my [Discord](https://discord.com/invite/kdwNmS3cBE).\n\n![Default Panorama Shader](https://cdn-raw.modrinth.com//data/kqc8wQyk/images/e69154506ba26912f4d72ae6b3784f47b17610b7.png)\n\nThe default, build-in shader \"Neonwave Sunrise\" by **mrange**, licensed under CC0.   \nSee original here: [Shadertoy](https://www.shadertoy.com/view/7dyyRy).","2022-08-23T14:34:32.857533Z","2024-06-27T18:43:17.315236Z",{"id":30248,"name":30249,"url":3565},19622,45,[100],[303],[346],[32003,32004,32005,32006,32007,32008,32009,32010,32011,32012],"mf7lkVmc","8z96z1Gf","essDshzM","63IJHUie","1N0uJbG7","jHnB4vr6","KpBqGhh7","2N75Hu8y","Yi3m1i2O","S0Ey9gGS","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqc8wQyk/icon.png","https://github.com/magistermaks/mod-glsl/issues","https://github.com/magistermaks/mod-glsl","https://github.com/magistermaks/mod-glsl/wiki","https://discord.com/invite/kdwNmS3cBE",[],[32020,32025,32031,32037,32043],{"url":32021,"raw_url":32021,"featured":439,"title":32022,"description":32023,"created":32024,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqc8wQyk/images/2f75970d48a8ec3a663ce070999e0ed3712cef85.png","Settings screen","Panorama shader settings","2022-08-23T14:38:55.630690Z",{"url":32026,"raw_url":32027,"featured":439,"title":32028,"description":32029,"created":32030,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqc8wQyk/images/a6c7ddfd0926afb0361e4f980a192e501ba3a6fe_350.web