,"additional_categories":32065,"loaders":32066,"versions":32067,"icon_url":32069,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":32070,"gallery":32071,"color":32077,"thread_id":32078,"monetization_status":30007},[2060],"kpbrUXCg","excalibur-biomesoplenty","wk5hgrTH","Excalibur - Biomes O' Plenty","Biomes O' Plenty in a Excalibur style","[Biomes O' Plenty](https://modrinth.com/mod/biomes-o-plenty) in [Excalibur](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/excal) style\n\nback-porting [Biomes O' Plenty - Excalibur](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/biomes-o-plenty-excalibur) to 1.12.2.\n\n![Screenshot 1](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbrUXCg/images/4a3e25c4603b76bcb690dfa795293433b9a415ff.png)","2025-10-15T08:54:24.574776Z","2025-10-15T09:04:11.050012Z","2025-10-16T04:29:38.746880Z","2025-10-15T09:04:39.009002Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},677,[15,57,292],[],[377],[32068],"Jl6CVirZ","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbrUXCg/e8ba36cac0245accb6ceb08375bd70de06b59520_96.webp",[],[32072],{"url":32073,"raw_url":32074,"featured":822,"title":32075,"description":3565,"created":32076,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbrUXCg/images/4a3e25c4603b76bcb690dfa795293433b9a415ff_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kpbrUXCg/images/4a3e25c4603b76bcb690dfa795293433b9a415ff.png","Palm Forest in Excalibur style","2025-10-15T08:58:59.062774Z",4677206,"2OsNQurP",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":32080,"id":32081,"slug":32082,"project_type":31,"team":32083,"organization":3565,"title":32084,"description":32085,"body":32086,"body_url":3565,"published":32087,"updated":32088,"approved":32089,"queued":32090,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":32091,"downloads":32092,"followers":31648,"categories":32093,"additional_categories":32094,"loaders":32095,"versions":32096,"icon_url":32106,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":32107,"donation_urls":32108,"gallery":32111,"color":32127,"thread_id":32128,"monetization_status":30007},[1016,983,941,935,863,820,814,766,763,733,685,643,634,628],"kr8MOAlY","mob-collision-off","9c3mj76e","Mob Collision Off","Disables collisions between entities, gives better TPS and may slightly increase FPS (Stable)","## EN\nMob Collision Off - eliminates mob collisions to improve performance.\n\nThis will improve TPS stability and may slightly increase FPS because it doesn't calculate entity collisions.\n\n---\n## RU\nMob Collision Off - устраняет столкновение мобов друг с другом для повышения производительности.\n\nЭто повысит стабильность TPS и может чуть увеличить FPS, потому что не рассчитывает столкновение сущностей.\n","2025-03-12T04:09:23.940461Z","2026-04-11T14:26:06.371121Z","2025-03-15T20:22:02.348419Z","2025-03-12T04:16:36.824360Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},205900,[134,191,211],[93],[346,354,385],[32097,32098,32099,32100,32101,32102,32103,32104,32105],"cjt7qbSh","6jTXWzeF","w1Clb04y","xxRwEA2n","S6BZMMSs","ae1yqoEC","PRJ8DyMh","MiQ8orIY","qp4MjYZ2","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kr8MOAlY/0c97c8255053d694febc77dc1415d5d5d7b30899_96.webp","https://discord.gg/wnhWHajK4v",[32109],{"id":3125,"platform":3126,"url":32110},"https://boosty.to/gvoper/donate",[32112,32116,32121],{"url":32113,"raw_url":32114,"featured":439,"title":3565,"description":3565,"created":32115,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kr8MOAlY/images/0c97c8255053d694febc77dc1415d5d5d7b30899_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kr8MOAlY/images/0c97c8255053d694febc77dc1415d5d5d7b30899.png","2025-03-12T04:15:32.559141Z",{"url":32117,"raw_url":32118,"featured":439,"title":424,"description":32119,"created":32120,"ordering":29979},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kr8MOAlY/images/537e587b32036c3b25b6f93876e3b181b2b51814_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kr8MOAlY/images/537e587b32036c3b25b6f93876e3b181b2b51814.png","RAM 9780","2025-04-07T12:48:43.004337Z",{"url":32122,"raw_url":32123,"featured":439,"title":32124,"description":32125,"created":32126,"ordering":30023},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kr8MOAlY/images/ae17aa019cf77418d4ef8745c691ab8c46341763_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kr8MOAlY/images/ae17aa019cf77418d4ef8745c691ab8c46341763.png","Collision Off","RAM 7060","2025-04-07T12:49:14.682852Z",11955562,"sbFBJ3s5",{"client_side":29964,"server_side":29963,"game_versions":32130,"id":32131,"slug":32132,"project_type":31,"team":32133,"organization":3565,"title":32134,"description":32135,"body":32136,"body_url":3565,"published":32137,"updated":32138,"approved":32139,"queued":32140,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":32141,"downloads":30896,"followers":29998,"categories":32142,"additional_categories":32143,"loaders":32144,"versions":32145,"icon_url":32147,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":32148,"donation_urls":32149,"gallery":32150,"color":32163,"thread_id":32164,"monetization_status":30007},[820,814,766,763,733,685,643,634,628,583,577,532,478,472,459],"kqVDm9Ov","eliterename","HUYWHN8T","EliteRename","Rename, Items, Lore, Enchant Lore, Attribute Lore and more.","![EliteRenameSplash](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7d187cc0945ad5115e41ca72b9f27b4570932920_0.webp)\n**EliteRename** is a lightweight, state-driven item metadata manipulation plugin designed for Paper 1.21. It bypasses rigid vanilla client-side rendering by utilizing persistent data storage and strict component recreation, granting users total control over item display names, lore arrays, enchantment displays, and attribute modifiers.\n\n1. Core Rendering & Formatting Pipeline\n\n    MiniMessage Integration: Drops legacy string formatting in favor of the Adventure API’s MiniMessage, allowing for complex RGB gradients, hex colors, and rich text components (\u003C!italic>, \u003Cbold>) parsed safely into native Component objects.\n\n    Dynamic Lore Reconstruction: Utilizes a pipeline (rebuildLoreOnMeta) that acts as a single source of truth for the item's visible lore array. It concatenates custom enchant labels and user-defined lore on the fly, ensuring that UI updates remain synchronized with underlying data structures.\n\n2. Data Persistence (PDC)\n\n    Isolated Storage: Rather than storing custom data in fragile string-based lore lines, the plugin serializes state into JSON arrays and objects using Gson and stores them directly in the item's PersistentDataContainer (PDC).\n\n    Namespaced Keys: Uses dedicated keys (KEY_ENCHANT_LABELS, KEY_USER_LORE) to separate plugin-managed data from vanilla NBT data or foreign plugin modifications, preventing collisions and allowing foreign items to degrade gracefully when edited.\n\n3. Client UI Obfuscation & Emulation\n\n    Enchantment Faking (/enchlabel): Applies ItemFlag.HIDE_ENCHANTS to suppress the hardcoded client tooltip. It then prepends user-defined, non-italic gray text to the lore array, perfectly mimicking the vanilla enchantment display while allowing custom naming (e.g., changing \"Sharpness\" to \"Blade of Doom\").\n\n    Attribute Injection (/renameattr): Applies ItemFlag.HIDE_ATTRIBUTES to hide default weapon/tool modifiers. It reads the item's AttributeModifiers (or falls back to the material's vanilla defaults), factors in the base player entity stats (e.g., 1.0 base damage, 4.0 base speed), and injects a mathematically accurate, visually identical replica of the vanilla \"When in Main Hand:\" tooltip directly into the PDC lore array. This transforms hardcoded client attributes into fully mutable text.\n\n4. State Management (The Regret Machine)\n\n    Session-Based Undo Stack: Maintains a transient, per-player Deque\u003CItemStack> mapped by UUID.\n\n    LIFO Memory: Captures deep clones of the ItemStack immediately prior to any mutation. The stack is capped at 5 states per session to prevent memory leaks and acts as a Last-In-First-Out rollback mechanism, verifying item types match before restoring ItemMeta.\n\n5. Utility & Quality of Life\n\n    Identity Theft (/rename steal): A context-aware cloning method that reads the ItemMeta of the offhand item, extracts its display name and PDC-stored user lore (falling back to raw lore for foreign items), and overwrites the main-hand item while preserving the main-hand's native enchantments.\n\n    Contextual Tab-Completion: The command router features deep tab-completion that queries the item's current internal state in real-time. For example, typing /setlore 1  dynamically serializes and suggests the exact MiniMessage string currently sitting on line 1, allowing for rapid in-place typo corrections.\n\n\n```\ncommands:\n  rename:\n    description: Rename held item, reset it, undo a change, or steal identity from your offhand.\n    usage: /rename [reset | undo | steal | \u003Ctext...>]\n    permission: elr.rename.player\n  setlore:\n    description: Set or replace a specific lore line.\n    usage: /setlore \u003Cline> \u003Ctext...>\n    permission: elr.lore\n  addlore:\n    description: Append a new lore line.\n    usage: /addlore \u003Ctext...>\n    permission: elr.lore\n  removelore:\n    description: Remove a specific lore line by number.\n    usage: /removelore \u003Cline>\n    permission: elr.lore\n  clearlore:\n    description: Strip all user lore from the held item.\n    usage: /clearlore\n    permission: elr.lore\n  enchlabel:\n    description: Apply a custom visual label to a specific enchantment.\n    usage: /enchlabel \u003Cenchant> [\u003Ctext...> | reset]\n    permission: elr.enchant\n  iteminfo:\n    description: View metadata details for the held item.\n    usage: /iteminfo [field]\n    permission: elr.info\n  renameattr:\n    description: Hides vanilla attributes and converts them into editable lore.\n    usage: /renameattr \u003Ctrue|false>\n    permission: elr.renameattr\n\npermissions:\n  elr.rename.player:\n    description: Allows regular players to use the /rename command.\n    default: true\n  elr.rename:\n    description: Explicit admin grant for the /rename command.\n    default: op\n  elr.lore:\n    description: Allows the use of /setlore, /addlore, /removelore, and /clearlore.\n    default: op\n  elr.enchant:\n    description: Allows the use of the /enchlabel command.\n    default: op\n  elr.info:\n    description: Allows reading item metadata using /iteminfo.\n    default: true\n  elr.renameattr:\n    description: Allows Hiding of vanilla attributes and converts them into editable lore using /renameattr.\n    default: true\n  elr.admin:\n    description: Full access to all EliteRename commands and features.\n    default: op\n```\n\nVersion 1.0 (Steal feature not yet working how I would prefer, it does work it just feels not... intrusive enough due to it looking at matching as needed)\n","2026-05-22T00:32:59.894814Z","2026-05-22T00:48:50.404635Z","2026-05-24T01:55:01.145535Z","2026-05-22T00:57:18.151010Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":3565},[115,175,303],[],[401],[32146],"XSgSmSU6","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqVDm9Ov/de84b203c20d996b56ca4dda26bad82de11d0e60.png","https://discord.gg/7TMMrt7eTG",[],[32151,32157],{"url":32152,"raw_url":32153,"featured":439,"title":32154,"description":32155,"created":32156,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqVDm9Ov/images/45792351850dc41bfc6ac300bc7b4ab6325cfddd_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqVDm9Ov/images/45792351850dc41bfc6ac300bc7b4ab6325cfddd.png","FullyCustomItems","Full control over item tooltips, none of this displayed is default.The 60k is a joke but the point is enchantments over 10 display less appealing info that can now be edited. My next plugin is coming to remove enchant limits up to 255 next via command ofc","2026-05-22T00:47:42.693119Z",{"url":32158,"raw_url":32159,"featured":439,"title":32160,"description":32161,"created":32162,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqVDm9Ov/images/c62943e08b95c7be003f467f72283f8266f222cd_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqVDm9Ov/images/c62943e08b95c7be003f467f72283f8266f222cd.png","/iteminfo","The iteminfo command lists the metadata of the item in chat for you.","2026-05-22T00:41:35.668285Z",300284,"FPw0aZfO",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":30119,"game_versions":32166,"id":32167,"slug":32168,"project_type":34,"team":32169,"organization":3565,"title":32170,"description":32171,"body":32172,"body_url":3565,"published":32173,"updated":32174,"approved":32175,"queued":32176,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":32177,"downloads":32178,"followers":32179,"categories":32180,"additional_categories":32181,"loaders":32182,"versions":32183,"icon_url":32187,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":32188,"donation_urls":32189,"gallery":32190,"color":32191,"thread_id":32192,"monetization_status":30007},[1016,814],"kr5xeoGG","vinland-survival","hgGke2Eh","Vinland Survival","Vanilla Experience I Performance Boost I Actions & Stuff Features I Visual & Sound Overhaul l Revamped Vanilla Structures I QoL Enhancements I Embark on an epic quest to find Vinland, a legendary land of peace and freedom","\n###  **\u003Ccenter> FIND VINLAND IN THIS MINECRAFT ADVENTURE \u003C/center>**\n \n____________________________________________________________________________________\n![.](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aa9e804ec6c5d500502038b6900325a857a40a14.jpeg)\n\n______________________________________________________________________________________________\n**\u003Ccenter>Vinland Survival** is a modpack that improves on the vanilla Minecraft experience. We aim for performance and quality of life features, while introducing visual and auditory enhancements. Dive into a world where gameplay is smoother, features are more intuitive, and the sights and sounds of Minecraft are elevated to new heights. Join us on this journey to explore the beauty of Vinland and embark on an unforgettable adventure in the world of Minecraft\u003C/center>\n______________________________________________________________________________________________\n**_\u003Ccenter>The best minecraft vanilla journey\u003C/center>_**\n\n_You awaken amidst the vast, untamed wilderness, where the whispers of ancient sagas linger in the air like echoes of forgotten dreams. In this realm of untold wonders and perilous trials, the call of adventure beckons you forth, igniting the flame of discovery within your heart._\n\n_As you navigate the rugged landscape, you realize that survival is not merely a matter of strength and endurance but a journey of self-discovery and exploration. The quest for Vinland, a legendary land of promise and opportunity, becomes your guiding light, driving you forward through the trials and tribulations that lie ahead._\n\n_But beyond the allure of uncharted territories and the thrill of conquest lies a deeper truth: Vinland is more than just a destination - it is a sanctuary of peace and freedom. In Vinland, the chains of warfare and slavery are shattered, replaced by the fertile soil of liberty and tranquillity. Here, the notion that we are all slaves to something dissipates as we find ourselves liberated to embrace the beauty of existence and the boundless possibilities of a world unburdened by oppression._\n\n_With each step towards Vinland, you inch closer to a realm where the soul finds solace and the spirit soars. For in the haven of Vinland, you will finally know true liberation and the timeless allure of freedom's embrace._\n\n_**\u003Ccenter>This is where your saga truly begins.\u003C/center>**_\n______________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n## ✨ **Resource Packs**\n\nVinland transforms the visual atmosphere of Minecraft with carefully chosen resource packs that enhance every detail. From rich, realistic foliage to immersive animations, these added packs breathe new life into the game's textures and environments. Designed with compatibility and performance in mind, the packs work seamlessly together to create a visually stunning experience.\n\n**\u003Ccenter>📖 IF THE RESOURCE PACKS AREN'T PRE LOADED, USE THIS ORDER TO PREVENT COMPATIBILITY ISSUES 📖**\u003C/center>\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Open For More Information\u003C/summary>\n\n- [Authentic Shadows](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/authentic-shadows) by Liahim85\n- [Rethoughted Trident](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/rethoughted-trident) by CatFromNet\n- Alittl Axolotl & Friends by Traben\n- [Als Boss Rush FA](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/als-boss-rush-x-fresh-animations) by ALtheGatorMC\n- [Armory Conglomery](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/armory-conglomery) by lukidonu\n- [Better Boat](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/better-boat) by Rozarke\n- [Better Lanterns](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/better-lanterns) by Nico4play\n- Luminous by Techy69\n- [Blockier Goat Horn](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/blockier-goat-horn) by bebebea_loste\n- [Pixelby](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/pixelby) by SaltyLight\n- [Eclectic Trove Legendary Tooltips](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/eclectic-trove-legendary-tooltips) by Grend\n- [Better Carpets](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/better-carpets) by DoomedArtemis\n- [Als Creepers Revamped](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/als-creepers-revamped) by ALtheGatorMC\n- [Even Better Enchants](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/even-better-enchants) by mythitorium\n- [Serified Font](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/serified-font) by bebebea_loste\n- [Enchant Icons Colorless](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/enchant-icons-colorless-countxd) by CountXD\n- [Bedrock Water Colors](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/bedrock-water-colors) by mineland \n- [Drodis Illagers FA](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/drodis-illagers-fresh-animation) by Drodi\n- [Drodis Villagers FA](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/drodis-villagers-fa) by Drodi\n- [Fresh Skeleton Physics](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fresh-skeleton-physics) by ewanhowell5195\n- [Better HorsesxFresh Animations](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/better-horses-x-fresh-animations) by CanineGray\n- [FA (All_Extensions)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-extensions) by FreshLX\n- [Fresh Animations](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fresh-animations) by FreshLX\n- [Simple Grass Flowers](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/simple-grass-flowers) by JamieCubed - Use at a higher priority level than VanillaTweaks\n- VanillaTweaks (custom build)\n- [NatureX](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/nature-x) by hothaifah\n\n**📖 IMPORTANT INFORMATION**\n\nThe following resource packs were combined into the resource pack called **VanillaTweaks** to resolve some compatibility issues between them. So please **use the matchable resource instead of the following 2** (they are still included in the folder as their authors own all their rights). Thank you for the incredible work:\n- [Mandala's GUI - Dark mode](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/mandalas-gui-dark-mode) by CesarZorak\n- [Vanilla Experience+](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/vanilla-exp) by Kryqu\n  \n\u003C/details>\n\n\n## 👁️ Shaderpacks\n\n- [Miniature Shader](https://modrinth.com/shader/miniature-shader) by ukrech\n\n**_\u003Ccenter>A lightweight shader aligned with the vanilla experience!\u003C/center>_**\n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ByfRnSTrr-A\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n\n______________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n## ⚡ Performance & Optimization\n\nThis modpack delivers a smoother, faster and more responsive Minecraft experience. With an optimised suite of performance-enhancing mods, every aspect of the game is tuned, from chunk loading and rendering to reducing server load. Whether you're exploring vast landscapes or diving into complex builds, these improvements work behind the scenes to minimise lag, improve frame rates, and improve your gameplay.\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Open For More Information\u003C/summary>\n  \n- [Badoptimizations](https://modrinth.com/mod/badoptimizations) | Fixes and improves poorly optimized vanilla mechanics\n- [Blanket](https://modrinth.com/mod/blanket) | Optimizes texture loading for improved performance\n- [Chunks fade in](https://modrinth.com/mod/chunks-fade-in) | Smooths chunk transition while loading the world\n- [Clumps](https://modrinth.com/mod/clumps) | Groups nearby xp entities to reduce server load\n- [Concurrent Chunk Management Engine](https://modrinth.com/mod/c2me-fabric) | Improves chunk management for smoother performance\n- [Cull Less Leaves](https://modrinth.com/mod/cull-less-leaves) | Reduces leaf processing to improve performance\n- [Debugify](https://modrinth.com/mod/debugify) | Provides debugging tools for diagnosing performance issues\n- [Dynamic FPS](https://modrinth.com/mod/dynamic-fps) | Dynamically adjusts frame rate for better performance\n- [Enhanced Block Entities](https://modrinth.com/mod/ebe) | Optimizes block entity processing for smoother gameplay\n- [Entity Culling](https://modrinth.com/mod/entityculling) | Removes invisible entities to alleviate server load\n- [FerriteCore](https://modrinth.com/mod/ferrite-core) | Increases chunk processing efficiency to enhance performance\n- [FeyTweaks](https://modrinth.com/mod/feytweaks) | Small performance improvements and gameplay tweaks\n- [GpuTape](https://modrinth.com/mod/gputape) | Fix VRAM leaks\n- [Highlight](https://modrinth.com/mod/highlight) | Highlights and fixes certain elements for easy identification during gameplay\n- [ImmediatelyFast](https://modrinth.com/mod/immediatelyfast) | Reduces input latency for faster player response\n- [Indium](https://modrinth.com/mod/indium) | Optimizes rendering for improved performance\n- [Krypton](https://modrinth.com/mod/krypton) | Improves network performance to reduce latency\n- [Ksyxis](https://modrinth.com/mod/ksyxis) | Speed up the loading of your world\n- [Lithium](https://modrinth.com/mod/lithium) | Improves server performance through various optimizations\n- [Memory Leak Fix](https://modrinth.com/mod/memoryleakfix) | Fixes memory leaks to prevent performance issues\n- [Mixintrace](https://modrinth.com/mod/mixintrace) | adds a list of mixins to classes in the stack trace to crash reports\n- [ModernFix](https://modrinth.com/mod/modernfix) | Fixes bugs and optimizations for improved performance\n- [More Culling](https://modrinth.com/mod/moreculling) | Increases efficiency of entity removal for better performance\n- [Noisium](https://modrinth.com/mod/noisium) | Reduces game-generated noise to improve performance\n- [Noxesium](https://modrinth.com/mod/noxesium) | Improves rendering performance for smoother gameplay\n- [Sodium](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium) | Implements an optimized rendering engine for better performance\n- [Sodium Dynamic Lights](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium-dynamic-lights) | An unofficial Forge/multiloader port of LambDynamicLights that integrates with Sodium\n- [Sodium Extra](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium-extra) | Provides additional features for the Sodium mod\n- [Sodium Leaf Culling](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodiumleafculling) | Smart leaf culling algorithm (Only on 1.21.1)\n- [ThreadTweak](https://modrinth.com/mod/threadtweak) | Optimizes thread usage to improve game performance\n- [Very Many Players](https://modrinth.com/mod/vmp-fabric) | Improves performance on servers with many players\n- [LMD](https://modrinth.com/plugin/lmd) | Improves performance by tweaking mob despawn rules \n- [Unloaded Activity](https://modrinth.com/mod/unloaded-activity) | When certain blocks such as crops or furnaces get out of simulation distance this mod will keep track of that\n- [Fastquit](https://modrinth.com/mod/fastquit) | Lets you return to the Title Screen early while your world is still saving in the background\n\n**Vanilla Performance**\n  \n![.](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/81633c05513ce9e3755843575d3384441ecf9d17.png)\n  \n**Performance With This Mods**\n  \n![.](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d3ad2e949a9ac191e2ce1e8f5b86114a0e8f5c64.png)\n\n   **SPECS:** Intel Core i9-12900x, RTX4080\n\u003C/details>\n______________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n## 👍 Action & Stuff Features in Java\n\nVinland Survival incorporates mechanics inspired by the Actions & Stuff resource pack from Minecraft Bedrock Edition. While not a direct port, this modpack brings similar immersive features to the Java Edition, including enhanced animations, detailed textures, and improved performance. Experience smoother player movements, dynamic mob behaviors, and a more vibrant game world, all while maintaining the essence of vanilla Minecraft.\n______________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n## 🕺 Revamped Movement & Combat Animations\n\nExperience a whole new level of fluidity with enhanced movement and combat animations. Every action, from sprinting to swordplay, feels more dynamic and immersive. Whether blocking attacks or delivering the perfect strike, the revamped animations bring a fresh layer of realism and responsiveness to your gameplay.\n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/x4kgMe_s3DA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/je9p7Gersq4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n## 🌍 World Generation & Exploration\n\nVenture into a beautifully reimagined Minecraft world where terrain generation is more diverse and breathtaking than ever. From towering mountains to lush forests, every biome feels more alive, with unique structures, dungeons, and secrets waiting to be uncovered. Prepare to embark on an adventure where exploration is as rewarding as survival!\n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jaBwFp2JO0k\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/eUGPz2Ur78I\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n\n______________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\n## ⚙️ Utility & Inventory\n\nWe've refined how you interact with your inventory and tools, making everything more efficient and user-friendly. From better inventory management to innovative interfaces, these quality-of-life improvements ensure you spend less time sorting through items and more time enjoying your adventure.\n\n## ✨ Breathtaking Visuals & UI Upgrades\n\nVinland Survival takes Minecraft's visuals to the next level with a carefully hand-picked selection of mods focusing on performance, clarity, and sheer aesthetic charm. Every detail, from falling leaves to enchanting particles, has been picked to create an immersive visual experience that transforms every landscape into a living masterpiece. In addition to enhanced visual effects, we've upgraded the UI, making it more intuitive and visually appealing. Explore the world with a refreshed interface and immerse yourself in the beauty of Vinland\n\n## 🛠️ Quality Of Life and New Features\n\nWe bring a variety of quality-of-life improvements and exciting new features to enhance your Minecraft experience. These carefully selected mods streamline everyday tasks, improve usability, and introduce intuitive mechanics to make gameplay smoother and more enjoyable. From tools that make inventory management easier to mods that improve progression, crafting and exploration, each addition is carefully selected to enhance the vanilla experience without overwhelming it. Whether you're looking to streamline your workflow, customise your world, or discover new adventures, these quality-of-life and feature-rich mods will make your journey smoother and more enjoyable.\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Open For More Information\u003C/summary>\n\n| Mod                                                                                  | Description                                                                                   |\n|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| [Advancement Plaques](https://modrinth.com/mod/advancement-plaques)                  | Adds decorative achievement plaques to the game.                                              |                                  \n| [Capes](https://modrinth.com/mod/capes)                                              | Allows players to wear custom capes.                                                          |\n| [Cave Dust](https://modrinth.com/mod/cave-dukeest)                                      | Adds dust particles in caves for visual effects.                 |\n| [Explosive Enhancement](https://modrinth.com/mod/explosive-enhancement)              | Enhances visual effects of explosions.                                                        |\n| [Falling Leaves](https://modrinth.com/mod/fallingleaves)                             | Adds falling leaves from trees for a more realistic atmosphere.                               |\n| [Crumbling Hearts](https://modrinth.com/mod/crumbling-hearts)                       | Replaces the default health bar with a sleek and customizable design.                         |\n| [Fancymenu](https://modrinth.com/mod/fancymenu)                                      | Customizes Minecraft menus with advanced layout and design options.                           |\n| [Flow](https://modrinth.com/mod/flow)                                                | Adds smooth animations for opening and closing inventories.                                   |\n| [Geophilic](https://modrinth.com/datapack/geophilic)                                 | Enhances terrain generation with more realistic and diverse landscapes.                       |\n| [Hide Experimental Warning](https://modrinth.com/mod/hide-experimental-warning)                                | Hides the Experimental Settings Warning when creating or loading a modded world.                       |\n| [Particle Effects](https://modrinth.com/mod/particle-effects)                               | Unique textured particles for every effect in vanilla Minecraft.                       |\n| [Immersive UI](https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-ui)                                | Enhances gameplay with smooth transitions, customizable menus, and animated UI elements.      |\n| [Leaves Be Gone](https://modrinth.com/mod/leaves-be-gone)                            | Removes transparent leaves faster to improve visibility.                                      |\n| [Cut Through](https://modrinth.com/mod/cut-through) | Cleanly swing through transparent blocks like tall grass to hit mobs without breaking said block\n| [Legendary Tooltips](https://modrinth.com/mod/legendary-tooltips)                    | Adds customizable, animated tooltips for a polished and unique item display.                 |\n| [Make Bubbles Pop](https://modrinth.com/mod/make_bubbles_pop)                        | Adds animation to water bubbles.                                                             |                                                \n| [Not Enough Animations](https://modrinth.com/mod/not-enough-animations)              | Adds additional animations for various actions.                                               |\n| [Particle Rain](https://modrinth.com/mod/particle-rain)                              | Adds rain particle effects.                                                                  |\n| [Particular](https://modrinth.com/mod/particular)                                    | Adds customizable particle effects for enhanced visual detail.                               |\n| [Shoulder Surfing Reloaded](https://modrinth.com/mod/shoulder-surfing-reloaded)      | Adds an adjustable over-the-shoulder camera for a third-person perspective.                  |\n| [Smooth Scroll](https://modrinth.com/mod/smooth-scroll)                              | Enhances scrolling with smooth and fluid animations.                                         |\n| [Smooth Swapping](https://modrinth.com/mod/smooth-swapping)                          | Makes item transitions smoother (1.20.1 only).                                               |\n| [Snow Real Magic](https://modrinth.com/mod/snow-real-magic)                          | Improves snow mechanics with realistic layering and interactions.                            |\n| [Subtle Effects](https://modrinth.com/mod/subtle-effects)                            | Adds customizable particle effects and sounds for enhanced immersion.                        |\n| [Toggle Item Frames](https://modrinth.com/mod/toggle-item-frames)                    | Lets you make item frames invisible with a simple toggle.                                    |\n| [Tree Harvester](https://modrinth.com/mod/tree-harvester)                   | Harvest full trees and huge mushrooms instantly with an axe.                                    |\n| [Traveler's Titles](https://modrinth.com/mod/travelers-titles)                       | Displays custom titles for players.                                                          |\n| [Visuality](https://modrinth.com/mod/visuality)                                      | Enhances game graphics for a more enjoyable visual experience.                               |\n| [Wakes](https://modrinth.com/mod/wakes)                                              | Adds wave effects behind boats and players.                                                  |\n| [Wavey Capes](https://modrinth.com/mod/wavey-capes)                                  | Adds animation to player capes.                                                              |\n| [What Are They Up To](https://modrinth.com/mod/what-are-they-up-to)                  | Shows the current actions of other players in real-time.                                     |\n| [3D Skin Layers](https://modrinth.com/mod/3dskinlayers)                              | Adds three-dimensional layers to player skins.                                               |\n| [Amendments](https://modrinth.com/mod/amendments)                                        | Enhances vanilla blocks with improved visuals and functionality.                                              |\n| [Antique Atlas 4](https://modrinth.com/mod/antique-atlas-4)                              | Adds a unique, hand-drawn map for tracking your world and exploring with style.                               |\n| [AppleSkin](https://modrinth.com/mod/appleskin)                                          | Provides additional information about food nutrition.                                                         |                                                      