imize world performance and reduce lag.                                            |                                                   \n| [Controlling](https://modrinth.com/mod/controlling)                                      | Makes viewing and assigning controls easier.                                                                  |\n| [Do a Barrel Roll](https://modrinth.com/mod/do-a-barrel-roll)                            | Changes elytra flight to be more fun and semi-realistic.                                                      |\n| [Detail Armor Bar](https://modrinth.com/mod/detail-armor-bar)                            | Displays detailed armor durability directly on the armor bar.                                                 |                                                  |\n| [Draggable Lists](https://modrinth.com/mod/draggable-lists)                              | Draggable resource packs, datapacks, servers, and worlds.                                                     |\n| [Dungeons And Taverns-pillager-outpost-overhaul](https://modrinth.com/datapack/dungeons-and-taverns-pillager-outpost-overhaul) | Transforms pillager outposts into more complex and challenging structures.                                     |\n| [Easy Anvils](https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-anvils)                                      | Makes working with anvils much more enjoyable.                                                                |\n| [Easy Elytra Takeoff](https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-elytra-takeoff)                      | Simplifies elytra launches by enabling takeoff from the ground.                                               |\n| [Easy Shulker Boxes](https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-shulker-boxes)                        | Access shulker box inventories directly without placing them.                                                 |\n| [Effect Descriptions](https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-descriptions)                      | Find out what potion effects do.