rit stats equal to or better than their parents, improving horse breeding logic.             \n- [Language Reload](https://modrinth.com/mod/language-reload) | Allows reloading game translations during runtime.                                                            \n- [Leaf Me Alone](https://modrinth.com/mod/leaf-me-alone) | Allows entities with controllable passengers to move through leaves and improves camera movement in leaf collisions.                                                                                     \n- [Mouse Tweaks](https://modrinth.com/mod/mouse-tweaks) | Enhances inventory interaction using the mouse.                                                                                                                                                                           \n- [No Chat Reports](https://modrinth.com/mod/no-chat-reports) | Prevents and protects from chat reports.                                                                                                                              \n- [Orthocamera](https://modrinth.com/mod/orthocamera) | Adds an orthographic camera view for unique perspectives.                                                     \n- [Pick Up Notifier](https://modrinth.com/mod/pick-up-notifier) | Displays notifications for picked-up items.                                                                   \n- [Realistic Bees](https://modrinth.com/mod/realistic-bees) | Improves bee behaviour with more natural and immersive mechanics.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          \n- [Rightclickharvest](https://modrinth.com/mod/rightclickharvest) | Harvest and replant crops instantly with a right-click.                                                                                                        \n- [Scribble](https://modrinth.com/mod/scribble) | Adds buttons to format text and customize books easily.                                                                                              \n- [Status Effect Bars](https://modrinth.com/mod/status-effect-bars) | Displays status effect bars in a better way.                                                                  \n- [Terrastorage](https://modrinth.com/mod/terrastorage) | Brings Terraria's amazing storage features to Minecraft.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n- [ToolTipFix](https://modrinth.com/mod/tooltipfix) | Fixes tooltip display issues.                                                                                                                                                                                                            \n- [Viafabricplus](https://modrinth.com/mod/viafabricplus) | Enables cross-version compatibility for multiplayer servers.                                                  \n- [World-Host](https://modrinth.com/mod/world-host) | Host singleplayer worlds online for friends to join easily.                                                   \n- [World Play Time](https://modrinth.com/mod/world-play-time) | Tracks and displays the total playtime in each world.                                                         \n- [Your Options Shall Be Respected](https://modrinth.com/mod/yosbr) | Maintains player settings even on servers.                                                                    \n- [Yungs Bridges](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-bridges) | Adds naturally generated bridges to improve exploration and navigation.                                       \n- [Yungs Better Desert Temples](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-desert-temples) | Revamps desert temples with more intricate designs and improved loot.                                         \n- [Yungs Better End Island](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-end-island) | Enhances End Islands with improved terrain and unique features.                                               \n- [Yungs Better Jungle Temples](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-jungle-temples) | Upgrades jungle temples with intricate designs and enhanced challenges.                                       \n- [Yungs Better Mineshafts](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-mineshafts) | Reimagines mineshafts with sprawling layouts and immersive details.                                           \n- [Yungs Better Nether Fortresses](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-nether-fortresses) | Enhances Nether fortresses with intricate designs and improved exploration.                                   \n- [Yungs Better Ocean Monuments](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-ocean-monuments) | Revamps ocean monuments with enhanced layouts and new challenges.                                             \n- [Yungs Better Strongholds](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-strongholds) | Completely overhauls strongholds with expansive layouts and intricate designs.                                \n- [Yungs Better Witch Huts](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-witch-huts) | Transforms witch huts into larger, more detailed structures with added features.                              \n- [Yungs Extras](https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-extras) | Adds small but impactful vanilla+ structures like ruins, pillars, desert wells, and more.                     \n- [Zoomify](https://modrinth.com/mod/zoomify) | Allows zooming in and out of the screen.                                                                      \n- [AmbientSounds](https://modrinth.com/mod/ambientsounds) | Enhances the immersive experience by adding ambient sounds to different biomes and environments in Minecraft.\n- [Auditory](https://modrinth.com/mod/auditory-continued) | Improves the audio experience by enhancing sound effects and adding depth to the game's auditory atmosphere.\n- [Coolrain](https://modrinth.com/mod/coolrain) | Creates ambient sounds for certain blocks during rain.\n- [Drip Sounds](https://modrinth.com/mod/dripsounds-fabric) | Adds realistic dripping sounds to caves and underground areas, enhancing the environmental ambience.\n- [Dynamic Surroundings](https://modrinth.com/mod/dynamicsurroundingsfabric) | Alters the fabric of Minecraft experience by weaving a tapestry of sound and visual effects.\n- [Immersive Thunder](https://modrinth.com/mod/immersivethunder) | Adds dynamic thunder sounds for a more immersive experience.                                   \n- [Presence Footsteps](https://modrinth.com/mod/presence-footsteps) | Enhances immersion by adding realistic footstep sounds that vary based on the surface being walked on.\n- [Sound Physics Remastered](https://modrinth.com/mod/sound-physics-remastered) | Improves the realism of sound propagation in the game, making audio behave more realistically based on distance and obstacles.\n- [Sounds](https://modrinth.com/mod/sound) | Enhances and expands the range of sound effects in Minecraft, adding more depth and variety to the auditory experience.\n- [Lighty](https://modrinth.com/mod/lighty) | Allows to turn on a overlay to check lighted areas.\n- [Tree Harvester](https://modrinth.com/mod/tree-harvester) | Harvest full trees and huge mushrooms instantly with an axe.  \n- [Hide Experimental Warning](https://modrinth.com/mod/hide-experimental-warning) | Hides the Experimental Settings Warning when creating or loading a modded world.\n- [Cut Through](https://modrinth.com/mod/cut-through) | Cleanly swing through transparent blocks like tall grass to hit mobs without breaking said block  \n- [Fancy Health Bar](https://modrinth.com/mod/fancy-health-bar) | Adds health lose particles.\n- [LMD](https://modrinth.com/plugin/lmd) | Improves performance by tweaking mob despawn rules                      \n- [Unloaded Activity](https://modrinth.com/mod/unloaded-activity) | When certain blocks such as crops or furnaces get out of simulation distance this mod will keep track of that\n- [Fastquit](https://modrinth.com/mod/fastquit) | Lets you return to the Title Screen early while your world is still saving in the background\n- [Amplified Nether](https://modrinth.com/datapack/amplified-nether) | Doubled height and amplified nether terrain\n- [Particle Effects](https://modrinth.com/mod/particle-effects) | Unique textured particles for every effect in vanilla Minecraft.\n### New After 3.0.0 Version\n- Data Loader\n- Amplified Nether Height\n- Raise Sound Limit Simplified\n- Fadeless\n- Smooth Gui\n- Call Your Horse\n- Screenshot Viewer\n- Superb Steeds\n- Death Sorter\n- Better Safe Bed\n- Better Than Mending\n- Elytra Drag\n- Accurate Block Placement Reborn\n- No Animal Tempt Delay\n- Stack Refill\n- Lootr\n- Hardcore Revival\n- Faster Random\n- Carry On\n- A Good Place\n- Door Knocking\n- Horseshoes\n- Armorable Skeleton Horses\n\n## Mods Only In 1.21.1 Version\n \n- [Better Beds](https://modrinth.com/mod/better-beds) | Improves beds rendering and revamps its visual.                     \n- [BIA](https://modrinth.com/mod/bia) | Animates item movement inside of inventories.                   \n- [Entity Pin Cushions](https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-pin-cushions) | Lets arrows stick into most mobs, not just players. \n- [Inventory Blur](https://modrinth.com/mod/inventory-blur) | Adds blur effects for a more immersive visual experience.  \n- [Horse Trumpet](https://modrinth.com/datapack/horse-trumpet) | Use a Goat Horn to locate your tamed horse whenever you lose them.   |              \n- [Scalablelux](https://modrinth.com/mod/scalablelux) | Improves the performance of light updates. \n- [Sodium Leaf Culling](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodiumleafculling) | Smart leaf culling algorithm |\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\n## 🛑 Setup & Important Notes\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Open For More Information\u003C/summary>\n\n### Flashback Mod ###\n- The Flashback Mod only works with the following mods and resource packs disabled(they are enabled by default, so you need to turn them off if you want to record gameplay):\n  1. Very Many Players mod\n  2. Concurrent Chunk Management Engine mod\n  3. Nature X resource pack\n\n### How To Install The ModPack ###\n  \n- You can use [Modrinth Application](https://modrinth.com/app) or other launchers that can install modpacks from Modrinth, such as [PrismLaucher](https://prismlauncher.org/).\n- If you use an official launcher, use the [Modrinth Pack to Zip Converter](https://jamie.codeberg.page/mrpack-to-zip/@master/) to convert it from .mrpack to .zip.\n\n### How To Allocate More Memory ###\n1. Open Instance Settings.\n2. Click Java and Memory.\n3. Enable Custom Memory Allocation.\n4. Allocate at least 4-6GB for optimal gameplay.\n\n### Future Work ###\n- Add a quest system\n- Port to 1.21.5\n\n### Play as you want ###\nFeel free to add whatever mods and resourcepacks you want, and shape it to your liking because never forget, if you can imagine it, you can do it; follow the path of your adventure.\n\n\u003C/details>","2024-03-26T15:05:58.667615Z","2025-05-14T04:21:15.124003Z","2024-03-31T02:54:50.179188Z","2024-03-29T17:05:17.966483Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},2536,25,[30,162,211],[],[346],[32184,32185,32186],"SfBslP7E","cO08KIHB","5No5yGQI","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kr5xeoGG/2e61cfc39874a5e4fd79d26e996a122a5eff5764_96.webp","https://discord.com/invite/a5689dfMsM",[],[],12369084,"KOe32ckJ",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":30119,"game_versions":32194,"id":32195,"slug":32196,"project_type":31,"team":32197,"organization":3565,"title":32198,"description":32199,"body":32200,"body_url":3565,"published":32201,"updated":32202,"approved":3565,"queued":3565,"status":29951,"requested_status":3565,"moderator_message":3565,"license":32203,"downloads":32204,"followers":31210,"categories":32205,"additional_categories":32206,"loaders":32207,"versions":32208,"icon_url":32211,"issues_url":32212,"source_url":32213,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":32214,"donation_urls":32215,"gallery":32216,"color":30088,"thread_id":32195,"monetization_status":30007},[1286,1271,1244,1187,1154,1145],"krZAZNhC","toggle-elytra","7yfloLRM","Toggle Elytra","A Fabric mod that adds a key to toggle Elytra flight.","# Toggle Elytra\nA Fabric mod that adds a key to toggle Elytra flight.\n\n# How to use it\nPress the toggle keybind (defaulted to: H) and it will switch your Elytra on and off.\n\n# Other Information\nIt should also work for every mod that uses the Fabric Elytra API, including Winged\n\nFor bug reporting please proceed to the mod's GitHub repository: https://github.com/CaelTheColher/ToggleElytra\n# \n\u003Cp style=\"text-align: center;\">\u003Ca href=\"https://discord.com/invite/G4PjhEf\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/707435077679841350/embed.png?style=banner2&amp;v=2\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\" />\u003C/a>\u003C/p>","2022-08-07T12:59:52.768395Z","2022-08-07T12:59:52.790130Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":3565},762,[303],[],[346],[32209,32210],"4pEptSHN","wBGpl08y","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krZAZNhC/icon.png","https://github.com/CaelTheColher/ToggleElytra/issues","https://github.com/CaelTheColher/ToggleElytra","https://discord.com/invite/G4PjhEf",[],[],{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29964,"game_versions":32218,"id":32219,"slug":32220,"project_type":31,"team":32221,"organization":3565,"title":32222,"description":32223,"body":32224,"body_url":3565,"published":32225,"updated":32226,"approved":32227,"queued":3565,"status":29952,"requested_status":29952,"moderator_message":3565,"license":32228,"downloads":32229,"followers":31053,"categories":32230,"additional_categories":32231,"loaders":32232,"versions":32233,"icon_url":3565,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":32235,"gallery":32236,"color":3565,"thread_id":32219,"monetization_status":30007},[2609],"krGlQGwy","infiview","dnipwQ8F","InfiView","Low-quality pseudo-infinite render distance","This mod will show you all explored areas of your world, by rendering them when you go near them, and saving the pictures. It's not perfect quality, or even good, but it works surprisingly well.\n\nNote that it can use quite a lot of disk space - hundreds of megabytes in my testing, probably gigabytes for larger worlds.\n\nConsider this an alpha release. Current limitations and issues:\n\n* It doesn't distinguish between different servers - data from one server will overwrite data from another server. (It does distinguish between different singleplayer worlds, and between singleplayer worlds and servers)\n* It breaks fog in the nether - the background will be black.\n* It doesn't handle night - all chunks rendered by InfiView will be fullbright.\n* It can cause significant FPS drops intermittently.\n\n(Original mod by immibis. Original description from [the FTB Forum](https://forum.feed-the-beast.com/threads/infiview-unlimited-view-distance-alpha-release-1-7-10.144731/))\n\n## Archival notice\n\n**This mod is abandoned and has been uploaded for archival purposes. It was originally created by [immibis](http://immibis.com/mcmoddl/). It has been uploaded to Modrinth under the ModrinthArchives account with permission from the original author.**\n\n![Discord screenshot showing permission to upload](https://cdn.modrinth.com/archives/immibis-permission.png)","2023-06-15T17:59:39.620943Z","2023-06-15T18:00:48.561865Z","2023-06-15T19:06:25.877655Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":3565},1062,[100],[],[354],[32234],"FbeqNBnu",[],[],{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29964,"game_versions":32238,"id":32239,"slug":32240,"project_type":12,"team":32241,"organization":3565,"title":32242,"description":32243,"body":32244,"body_url":3565,"published":32245,"updated":32246,"approved":32247,"queued":32248,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":32249,"downloads":32252,"followers":31215,"categories":32253,"additional_categories":32254,"loaders":32255,"versions":32256,"icon_url":32262,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":32263,"gallery":32268,"color":32298,"thread_id":32299,"monetization_status":30007},[1442,1367,1349,1286,1271,1244,1187,1154,1145,1109,1070,1022,1016,983,941,935,863,857,820,814,802,766,763,754,733,685,643,634,628,583,577,532,478,472,459],"krOlTFB3","pvp-haimiya-anime-pack","dw0eGkNU","PvP Haimiya Pack + Anime sky","The PvP/CPvP resource pack \"Haimiya\" adds a variety of textures, from the sky overlay to the GUI and sounds.","# ![Main](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5245f5b80760dffb0da52510c124f29f7b4b5338.png)This anime PvP resource pack in a red theme replaces or adds the following features:\n- Animated inventory\n- Custom GUI\n- Main menu background\n- Totem\n- Custom sword\n- Sky overlay \n- Item textures\n- Particles\n- Inventory has been updated\n- New widgets\n- Small Items\n- Sounds\n- Enchantment Glint\n- Crystals\n## The best version for this resource pack is 1.21.x and above.\n**On older versions, textures may display incorrectly or be completely missing. \nI will fix this issue soon.**\n## For sky overlays to work correctly on Fabric, you will need the following mods:\n1. [Nuit](https://modrinth.com/project/YBz7DOs8)\n2. [Skyboxify](https://modrinth.com/project/DWuwk8aA)\n## If you have any problems with sky overlay:\n- Check if \"Custom Sky\" is enabled in your graphics settings.\n- Check other included resource packs, they might be interferin\n### If you enjoy this project, consider following!","2026-05-03T19:37:17.330858Z","2026-05-16T18:21:21.160522Z","2026-05-09T02:08:22.635642Z","2026-05-06T12:31:39.861111Z",{"id":32250,"name":32251,"url":3565},"CC-BY-4.0","Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International",4837,[77,115,148],[50,100,113,197,303],[377],[32257,32258,32259,32260,32261],"A5lJHyFm","EuN7AKBW","SZ2zosRp","EBDRFb6C","32reINk6","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/856eec3034fcbca241b516cd8fd0e38cd1c6be95_96.webp",[32264,32266],{"id":3116,"platform":30230,"url":32265},"https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/OShymaa89",{"id":3122,"platform":3123,"url":32267},"https://ko-fi.com/shymaakek",[32269,32274,32279,32284,32289,32293],{"url":32270,"raw_url":32271,"featured":439,"title":32272,"description":3565,"created":32273,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/images/2f36e4653926cceae9531eaf3c6e438e0694b3c1_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/images/2f36e4653926cceae9531eaf3c6e438e0694b3c1.png","sky","2026-05-06T10:00:48.504791Z",{"url":32275,"raw_url":32276,"featured":439,"title":32277,"description":3565,"created":32278,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/images/55be88500caa393c87ef67526569fffbcbb6ac02_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/images/55be88500caa393c87ef67526569fffbcbb6ac02.png","inventory","2026-05-06T10:00:29.033953Z",{"url":32280,"raw_url":32281,"featured":439,"title":32282,"description":3565,"created":32283,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/images/6da34d5b402c3384c5bf88efe8e5c3e029d974b8_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/images/6da34d5b402c3384c5bf88efe8e5c3e029d974b8.png","menu","2026-05-06T10:01:03.115001Z",{"url":32285,"raw_url":32286,"featured":439,"title":32287,"description":3565,"created":32288,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/images/8e41daec0e8dafe9554646f1181927a5daf3c3d3_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/images/8e41daec0e8dafe9554646f1181927a5daf3c3d3.png","Totem","2026-05-09T08:53:22.757968Z",{"url":32290,"raw_url":32290,"featured":822,"title":32291,"description":3565,"created":32292,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/images/ce9ebfab8c1fffba11f995387b0d6db10b3e0523.gif","Main","2026-05-06T09:59:55.109772Z",{"url":32294,"raw_url":32295,"featured":439,"title":32296,"description":3565,"created":32297,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/images/ee44632f412fb224a5ec0244ddf1ec7239617037_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/krOlTFB3/images/ee44632f412fb224a5ec0244ddf1ec7239617037.png","sky F5","2026-05-06T10:00:20.125159Z",2896445,"bF0ARLm6",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29964,"game_versions":32301,"id":32302,"slug":32303,"project_type":34,"team":32304,"organization":3565,"title":32305,"description":32306,"body":32307,"body_url":3565,"published":32308,"updated":32309,"approved":32310,"queued":32311,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":32312,"downloads":32313,"followers":30465,"categories":32314,"additional_categories":32315,"loaders":32316,"versions":32317,"icon_url":32319,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":32320,"gallery":32321,"color":32376,"thread_id":32377,"monetization_status":30007},[820],"kqsBWRzP","simpleanimations","NJYI1Upw","Simple Animations","Turn your boring gameplay to a more captivating, enhanced gameplay with Simple Animations!","**_Note: Simple Animations might not recieve any further updates for latest minecraft versions. Effective until further notice._**\n\n![SA Minecraft Logo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d25fe9d1512056cca6c6040e98046534b6e4efa2.png)\n\n\n# Future Pack Update Progress\n![65% done for next pack update](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/afad23a56f311d61fa7010bebad2e217a7c194ea.png)\n\n\n## Loaders\n**Simple Animations** is solely based on **_Fabric_**. This modpack **will not** work on other loaders. Modpack tested on **Modrinth Launcher** so far.\n\n## Features\n**Player Animations:** Adapts to any skin. **Important: If your skin isn't showing, maybe your resource packs are out of orders. And if that doesnt help,** Google it.\n![Player Animations](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/90d3b013021296e329a018ae8db4b702a529d3a9.png)\n\n**Block Animations:** Adds particles to many blocks.\n![Block Animations](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8698a8963daefa4acdf0eba4b289ec7ffd6de4ce.png)\n\n**QoL:** Adds many Quality of life (QoL) mods!\n![QoL](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f510aad50f018040c1c5dc2d1b9fa5415c593b44.png)\n\n**Optimization:** _Simple Animation_ has built in optimization mods!\n![Optimization](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc7243967bed3ca4deb0f5e36dee7e36db3e691c.png)\n\n## Installation Guide\nHere's a quick guide on how to install this modpack on **Modrinth Launcher**, but other launchers should have similar options. **_Note: Go to \"Gallery\" and see step by step with instructions of this installation guide._**\n![Step 1](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/824379d79a1fec08831a90b794a271fc6e107f30.png)\n![Step 2](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1671e2d5f70bc9939ae5637f80765633e991f65e.png)\n![Step 3](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4e6814c2f305e9090b5ff85310c860e97d583f5a.png)\n![Step 4](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8fc7e2adb862b7dac5f6ca9647762c705962fc5e.png)\n\n\n## Mods\n- [Advancement Plaques](https://modrinth.com/mod/advancement-plaques) by Grend: Adds fancy advancement animation.\n- [AmbientSounds](https://modrinth.com/mod/ambientsounds) by creativemd: Adds Ambient noises\n- [AppleSkin](https://modrinth.com/mod/appleskin) by squeek502: Adds information about saturation & more.\n- [Better Clouds](https://modrinth.com/mod/better-clouds) by qendolin: Adds beautiful looking clouds without shaders.\n- [Better Ping Display](https://modrinth.com/mod/better-ping-display-fabric) by vladmarica: Shows each player's ping in a server as actual numbers.\n- [Better Statistics Screen](https://modrinth.com/mod/better-stats) by TheCSDev: Improves the default minecraft statistics screen.\n- [Blur+](https://modrinth.com/mod/blur-fabric) by Motschen: Adds blur to the background of every UI in game.\n- [Bounced](https://modrinth.com/mod/bounced) by KrLite: Makes your Minecraft Title bounce on log-in and when you click.\n- [Cave Dust](https://modrinth.com/mod/cave-dust) by LizIsTired: Adds dust particles to caves.\n- [Chat Animation](https://modrinth.com/mod/chatanimation) by Ezzenix: Adds a smooth animation when new chat messages appear.\n- [Chat Heads](https://modrinth.com/mod/chat-heads) by dzwdz: Adds player heads to chat messages.\n- [Cherished Worlds](https://modrinth.com/mod/cherished-worlds) by TheIllusiveC4: Adds the ability to favorite/pin/bookmark certain worlds.\n- [Chunks fade in](https://modrinth.com/mod/chunks-fade-in) by kerudion: Adds fade-in animation for chunks\n- [Cloth Config API](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config) by shedaniel: Config screen API.\n- [CreativeCore](https://modrinth.com/mod/creativecore) by creativemd: Core mod.\n- [Easy Anvils ](https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-anvils) by Fuzs: Makes anvil easier to use.\n- [Easy Magic](https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-magic) by Fuzs: Makes enchanting easier.\n- [Eating Animation](https://modrinth.com/mod/eating-animation) by theoness1: Adds eating animation to the game.\n- [Enhanced Block Entities](https://modrinth.com/mod/ebe) by FoundationGames: Turns entities into blocks to enhance fps & reduce lag.\n- [Entity Culling](https://modrinth.com/mod/entityculling) by tr7zw: Hides entites that are not the player's view.\n- [Explosive Enhancement](https://modrinth.com/mod/explosive-enhancement) by Superkat32: Enhances tnt & creeper explosions.\n- [Entity Model Features](https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features) by Traben: Adds support for OptiFine's Custom Entity Models.\n- [Entity Texture Features](https://modrinth.com/mod/entitytexturefeatures) by Traben: Adds many new Entity Texture Features, including entity and player skin features.\n- [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) by modmuss50: Essential hooks for modding with Fabric.\n- [Fabric Language Kotlin](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-language-kotlin) by modmuss50: Enables usage of the Kotlin programming language for Fabric mods.\n- [Falling Leaves](https://modrinth.com/mod/fallingleaves) by randommcsomethin: Adds falling leaves particle to trees and not just cherry trees.\n- [Fancy Block Particles - Renewed](https://modrinth.com/mod/fbp-renewed) by Hantonik: Turns basic 2D particles in vanilla Minecraft into cool 3D animated particles.\n- [FerriteCore](https://modrinth.com/mod/ferrite-core) by malte0811: Reduces the memory usage of Minecraft in a few different ways.\n- [Forge Config API Port](https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port) by Fuzs: Modding library for mod developers that provides both NeoForge's & Forge's whole config system to other modding ecosystems.\n- [Fresh Animations](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fresh-animations) by FreshLX: Resource pack that gives an animation overhaul to the creatures in the default look of Minecraft.\n- [Fresh Moves](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/tras-fresh-player) by TrasTick: A resource pack to animate the players.\n- [Iceberg](https://modrinth.com/mod/iceberg) by Grend: Library for other mods, it doesn't do anything by itself.\n- [ImmediatelyFast](https://modrinth.com/mod/immediatelyfast) by RaphiMC: Improves the immediate mode rendering performance of the client.\n- [ImmersiveThunder](https://modrinth.com/mod/immersivethunder) by netcatgirl: Makes thunders immersive.\n- [Indium](https://modrinth.com/mod/indium) by comp500: An addon for the rendering optimisation mod Sodium.\n- [Iris Shaders](https://modrinth.com/mod/iris) by coderbot: Adds shader support to fabric.\n- [Lithium](https://modrinth.com/mod/lithium) by jellysquid3: Improves gameplay when playing multiplayer.\n- [Mace but 3D](https://modrinth.com/mod/mace-but-3d) by Volery: Makes the mace 3D.\n- [Make Bubbles Pop](https://modrinth.com/mod/make_bubbles_pop) by Tschipcraft: Makes bubble particles pop.\n- [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) by Prospector: Lets you view the mods you have installed.\n- [More Chat History](https://modrinth.com/mod/morechathistory) by JackFred: Increases the maximum length of the chat history, from the vanilla 100 messages to 16384.\n- [Noisium](https://modrinth.com/mod/noisium) by Steveplays: Optimises worldgen performance for a better gameplay experience.\n- [Not Enough Animations](https://modrinth.com/mod/not-enough-animations) by tr7zw: Adds animations to certain actions.\n- [Not Enough Crashes](https://modrinth.com/mod/notenoughcrashes) by natanfudge: Gives more info when game crashes.\n- [Pick Up Notifier](https://modrinth.com/mod/pick-up-notifier) by Fuzs: Adds a pick up log.\n- [Presence Footsteps](https://modrinth.com/mod/presence-footsteps) by Sollace: An Overly complicated Sound Mod.\n- [Puzzles Lib](https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib) by Fuzs: A light-weight library.\n- [Reese's Sodium Options](https://modrinth.com/mod/reeses-sodium-options) by FlashyReese: Replaces Sodium's Options Screen with intention of improving UX.\n- [ReplayMod](https://modrinth.com/mod/replaymod) by Johni0702: Allows you to record, replay and share your gaming experience.\n- [Screenshot to Clipboard](https://modrinth.com/mod/screenshot-to-clipboard) by comp500: Copies screenshots that you take to your clipboard.\n- [Shoulder Surfing Reloaded](https://modrinth.com/mod/shoulder-surfing-reloaded) by Exopandora: Highly configurable third person camera mod for minecraft.\n- [Shulker Box Tooltip](https://modrinth.com/mod/shulkerboxtooltip) by MisterPeModder: Allows you to see a preview window of a shulker box contents.\n- [Smooth Gui](https://modrinth.com/mod/smooth-gui) by Ezzenix: GUIs fade up when opened.\n- [Smooth Scrolling Refurbished](https://modrinth.com/mod/smooth-scrolling-refurbished) by JustAlittleWolf: This mod changes the scrollbar in any screen that uses it to be smooth.\n- [Sodium](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium) by jellysquid3: Powerful rendering engine and optimization mod.\n- [Sodium Extra](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium-extra) by FlashyReese: Adds extra features to sodium.\n- [Sound Physics Remastered](https://modrinth.com/mod/sound-physics-remastered) by henkelmax: Provides realistic sound attenuation, reverberation, and absorption through blocks.\n- [TCDCommons API](https://modrinth.com/mod/tcdcommons) by TheCSDev: Minecraft modding API library.\n- [Text Placeholder API](https://modrinth.com/mod/placeholder-api) by Patbox: Allows creation and parsing placeholders within strings and Minecraft Text Components.\n- [Tiny Item Animations](https://modrinth.com/mod/tiny-item-animations) by Trivaxy: This mod adds little animations when you pick up or insert items with your mouse.\n- [Unique Dark](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/unique-dark) by AmongstReality: Adds dark UIs with their own textures.\n- [Vanilla Refresh](https://modrinth.com/datapack/vanilla-refresh) by limesplatus: Quality of life expansion.\n- [Visual Overhaul](https://modrinth.com/mod/visual-overhaul) by Motschen: Overhauls the visuals of certain vanilla blocks.\n- [Visual Workbench](https://modrinth.com/mod/visual-workbench) by Fuzs: Adds visual animations to workbenchs.\n- [Visuality](https://modrinth.com/mod/visuality) by PinkGoosik: Simple client-sided cosmetic mod.\n- [Wakes](https://modrinth.com/mod/wakes) by Goby56: Adds wakes when you're in water.\n- [YetAnotherConfigLib](https://modrinth.com/mod/yacl) by isxander: This mod was made to fill a hole in this area of Fabric modding.\n- [Zoomify](https://modrinth.com/mod/zoomify) by isxander: Adds zoom to Minecraft.\n\n## Socials\nCheck out my other socials for more contents and pack updates. _I may not be active or post all time_\n\n[\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/53cFPtY.png\" alt=\"YouTube Button\">](https://www.youtube.com/@CreppyMC)\n[\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mgooXO2.png\" alt=\"YouTube Button\">](https://x.com/@_Creppy)\n[\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OZE2fWa.png\" alt=\"SoloTo Button\">](https://solo.to/creppymc)\n[\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/44b3CYL.png\" alt=\"Linktree Button\">](https://linktr.ee/creppymc)\n[\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s4vLSSr.png\" alt=\"GitHub Button\">](https://github.com/creppymc)","2024-08-07T07:26:45.506055Z","2024-08-09T12:39:53.715517Z","2024-08-11T20:25:51.549094Z","2024-08-09T14:02:40.552352Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},1651,[30,162,211],[240],[346,362],[32318],"WEqYqfWe","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/e366870a5f2f419549c1ae10e2dfb88e92de585f_96.webp",[],[32322,32328,32334,32340,32346,32352,32358,32364,32370],{"url":32323,"raw_url":32324,"featured":439,"title":32325,"description":32326,"created":32327,"ordering":29979},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/824379d79a1fec08831a90b794a271fc6e107f30_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/824379d79a1fec08831a90b794a271fc6e107f30.png","Step 1","Click on \"Popular packs\" on modrinth launcher.","2024-08-09T13:54:32.174105Z",{"url":32329,"raw_url":32330,"featured":439,"title":32331,"description":32332,"created":32333,"ordering":30023},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/1671e2d5f70bc9939ae5637f80765633e991f65e_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/1671e2d5f70bc9939ae5637f80765633e991f65e.png","Step 2","Click on search and type \"Simple Animations\"","2024-08-09T13:55:09.514425Z",{"url":32335,"raw_url":32336,"featured":439,"title":32337,"description":32338,"created":32339,"ordering":30465},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/4e6814c2f305e9090b5ff85310c860e97d583f5a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/4e6814c2f305e9090b5ff85310c860e97d583f5a.png","Step 3","Click on \"Install\" on the first result, uploaded by \"Creppy\"","2024-08-09T13:57:15.882239Z",{"url":32341,"raw_url":32342,"featured":439,"title":32343,"description":32344,"created":32345,"ordering":30105},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/8fc7e2adb862b7dac5f6ca9647762c705962fc5e_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/8fc7e2adb862b7dac5f6ca9647762c705962fc5e.png","Step 4","Go to Home, and click on the play button on \"Simple Animations\" and enjoy!","2024-08-09T13:57:49.834810Z",{"url":32347,"raw_url":32348,"featured":439,"title":32349,"description":32350,"created":32351,"ordering":31048},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/90d3b013021296e329a018ae8db4b702a529d3a9_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/90d3b013021296e329a018ae8db4b702a529d3a9.png","Player animations","Different player animations for different actions","2024-08-09T12:42:50.603196Z",{"url":32353,"raw_url":32354,"featured":439,"title":32355,"description":32356,"created":32357,"ordering":31053},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/8698a8963daefa4acdf0eba4b289ec7ffd6de4ce_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/8698a8963daefa4acdf0eba4b289ec7ffd6de4ce.png","Block animations","Different animations for different blocks.","2024-08-09T12:43:37.589788Z",{"url":32359,"raw_url":32360,"featured":439,"title":32361,"description":32362,"created":32363,"ordering":30896},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/f510aad50f018040c1c5dc2d1b9fa5415c593b44_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/f510aad50f018040c1c5dc2d1b9fa5415c593b44.png","Quality of life mods (QoL)","A lot of quality of life mods (QoL)","2024-08-09T12:44:25.877862Z",{"url":32365,"raw_url":32366,"featured":439,"title":32367,"description":32368,"created":32369,"ordering":30439},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/dc7243967bed3ca4deb0f5e36dee7e36db3e691c_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/dc7243967bed3ca4deb0f5e36dee7e36db3e691c.png","Optimization mods","Simple Animations has built in optimization mods","2024-08-09T12:45:00.870055Z",{"url":32371,"raw_url":32372,"featured":822,"title":32373,"description":32374,"created":32375,"ordering":31210},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/7b79df26e714060fd3f529ec01e180f8321d41b6_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kqsBWRzP/images/7b79df26e714060fd3f529ec01e180f8321d41b6.jpeg","BANNER","banner","2024-08-09T13:58:44.613803Z",277604,"ZWdJa6Rz",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29964,"game_versions":32379,"id":32380,"slug":32381,"project_type":31,"team":32382,"organization":3565,"title":32383,"description":32384,"body":32385,"body_url":3565,"published":32386,"updated":32387,"approved":32388,"queued":32389,"status":29951,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":32390,"downloads":32391,"followers":30023,"categories":32392,"additional_categories":32393,"loaders":32394,"versions":32395,"icon_url":3565,"issues_url":32397,"source_url":32398,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":3565,"donation_urls":32399,"gallery":32400,"color":3565,"thread_id":32401,"monetization_status":30007},[577],"kr802EiA","axiom-buttons-for-servers","fN9b6MS2","Axiom Buttons for Servers","This is a minecraft Fabric mod which should show buttons to open Axioms color picker screen and the gradient screen even on server where there is no axiom installed","This is a minecraft Fabric mod which should show buttons to open Axioms blockcolorpickerscreen and gradientscreen from the inventory even on server where there is no axiom installed. You can also change if they are only rendered on multiplayer servers or only on singleplayer. (Not sure why you want to see them in singleplayer though)","2026-01-11T15:36:59.425856Z","2026-01-11T15:43:32.151442Z","2026-01-16T03:19:29.067221Z","2026-01-11T15:47:39.541355Z",{"id":30132,"name":30133,"url":3565},404,[],[],[346],[32396],"N2mFCDQQ","https://github.com/Lassilos/Axiom-Button/issues","https://github.com/Lassilos/Axiom-Button",[],[],"92TzVi7c",{"client_side":29963,"server_side":29964,"game_versions":32403,"id":32404,"slug":32405,"project_type":34,"team":32406,"organization":3565,"title":32407,"description":32408,"body":32409,"body_url":3565,"published":32410,"updated":32411,"approved":32412,"queued":32413,"status":29952,"requested_status":29951,"moderator_message":3565,"license":32414,"downloads":32415,"followers":29998,"categories":32416,"additional_categories":32417,"loaders":32418,"versions":32419,"icon_url":32422,"issues_url":3565,"source_url":3565,"wiki_url":3565,"discord_url":32423,"donation_urls":32424,"gallery":32427,"color":32440,"thread_id":32441,"monetization_status":30007},[1016],"kq3ux5fC","pixelwind","RSxq8YqI","PixelWind","Pure Performance Starter Modpack.","Archived - Dear fellow players, 8 months have passed since the realese of this Modpack, and many things have changed since then. Better mods and alternatives that make the game even smoother with bigger FPS boost! You can still download the Modpack, but it wont receive any updates. Thank you for your support.\n\n## PixelWind\n**Experience Minecraft like never before with the Ultimate FPS Boost Modpack, designed specifically for the best performance on Fabric!** Optimized for smooth gameplay, this modpack enhances frame rates, reduces lag, and improves overall game stability without compromising on the vanilla feel. Perfect for players who want lightning-fast performance on any machine. Whether you're exploring vast worlds or engaging in fast-paced combat, this modpack ensures your game runs as efficiently as possible! Having a low-end laptop or PC, especially when playing Minecraft, can lead to fps drops, memory instability and much more, while using this modpack with **numerous Performance Mods** ensures you that you are going to get the most out of your system!\n\nEverything is highly customizable, from the animations down to the light updates!\n\n**WARNING**; Switching everything off or messing with settings **can break the game!** If you don't know what you are doing, **don't mess around** with the advanced features! Also, there are some options that make the game look awfull, and don't give a good amount of fps, so consider watching a video explaining how all settings work if you want the best peformance with medium-style graphics.\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>News\u003C/summary>\n\nNow Upgraded from Alpha to Beta 0.19.10! With some new optimization mods, zoom and bug fixes!\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Difference\u003C/summary>\nBoth pictures are with the lowest settings, Vanilla and PixelWind, both powered by the intel i7 10750H and the RTX 2070 Super laptop. \n\n![Not getting above 500 FPS](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f166938526cb343a50f9b39c6f33f1a015e9757.png)\n![Managing above 1.500 FPS](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/efa094b7d64c5e55b4d5268372ad8d17eda1f2b5.png)\n\nAs you can see in the first picture, I am getting 500 FPS, while with my modded version of Minecraft, I managed to get 1.500 FPS all the time!\n\u003C/details>\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Mods\u003C/summary>\nBasic Mods I used;\n  \n-   Sodium\n-   Lithium\n-   Indium\n  etc.\n\u003C/details>\n\nIf you encounter any bugs, or want to suggest a way to make this modpack better, join our discord server!","2024-10-14T19:26:24.925063Z","2024-10-18T21:54:09.703303Z","2024-10-15T07:32:17.878643Z","2024-10-14T19:50:47.265810Z",{"id":29977,"name":10,"url":3565},70,[162,211,288],[],[346],[32420,32421],"MjCF0KLt","r0phZVw4","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kq3ux5fC/ba96cc0bc17741cc487b935991a8aac93c4233c8_96.webp","https://discord.gg/45DCAqRnAb",[32425],{"id":3116,"platform":30230,"url":32426},"https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=6PTLBQ2PL23ZC",[32428,32434],{"url":32429,"raw_url":32430,"featured":439,"title":32431,"description":32432,"created":32433,"ordering":29998},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kq3ux5fC/images/ba96cc0bc17741cc487b935991a8aac93c4233c8_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kq3ux5fC/images/ba96cc0bc17741cc487b935991a8aac93c4233c8.jpeg","Join our Modding Community!","Join our discord server and learn everything about PixelWind and our other Mods!","20